WEBVTT

1
00:01:02,375 --> 00:01:03,625
Mishty.

2
00:01:03,708 --> 00:01:04,916
Come on, hurry up.

3
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,500
We don't want to miss the train.

4
00:01:06,583 --> 00:01:09,333
Or you'll end up
spending your summer break at home.

5
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:17,041
My little swallow!

6
00:01:17,125 --> 00:01:18,500
You look so pretty.

7
00:01:23,083 --> 00:01:26,000
<i>Tiny little swallow</i>
<i>Cute little swallow</i>

8
00:01:26,083 --> 00:01:29,416
<i>Tiny little swallow</i>
<i>Cute little swallow</i>

9
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:32,708
<i>Tiny little swallow</i>
<i>Cute little swallow</i>

10
00:01:32,791 --> 00:01:34,958
<i>Tiny little swallow</i>
<i>Cute little swallow</i>

11
00:01:35,041 --> 00:01:35,958
Gone?

12
00:01:37,041 --> 00:01:40,708
<i>Flying, flying far away</i>

13
00:01:40,791 --> 00:01:44,083
<i>She lost her way and went astray</i>

14
00:01:44,166 --> 00:01:45,875
Ah…

15
00:01:49,291 --> 00:01:51,458
Green mango!

16
00:01:51,541 --> 00:01:52,500
Green mango!

17
00:01:53,333 --> 00:01:55,500
Papa, green mangoes.

18
00:01:55,583 --> 00:01:59,000
You want green mangoes, my love?
I'll go right away.

19
00:01:59,083 --> 00:02:01,000
Don't take too long. Come back soon.

20
00:02:01,083 --> 00:02:03,291
Yeah, I'll be back soon. Just two minutes.

21
00:02:03,375 --> 00:02:05,083
It's time for green mangoes.

22
00:02:11,250 --> 00:02:12,750
-Mamma.
-Hmm?

23
00:02:12,833 --> 00:02:15,041
Let's go.

24
00:02:16,708 --> 00:02:17,750
Let's go.

25
00:02:17,833 --> 00:02:18,833
Train-train?

26
00:02:20,250 --> 00:02:22,208
<i>Chuck-chuck goes the train and…</i>

27
00:02:22,291 --> 00:02:23,666
Let me open it.

28
00:02:23,750 --> 00:02:24,916
There you go.

29
00:02:31,708 --> 00:02:32,708
Stay right here.

30
00:02:32,791 --> 00:02:34,250
Don't go anywhere. Okay?

31
00:02:34,333 --> 00:02:38,666
And while I'm in the bathroom,
we'll sing the swallow song together, hmm?

32
00:02:38,750 --> 00:02:40,583
But first, you'll sing.

33
00:02:40,666 --> 00:02:42,208
Okay, my little swallow.

34
00:02:42,291 --> 00:02:43,541
Come on, let's start.

35
00:02:44,666 --> 00:02:47,125
<i>Tiny little swallow</i>
<i>Cute little swallow</i>

36
00:02:47,208 --> 00:02:49,833
<i>Lost in the woods</i>
<i>This little swallow</i>

37
00:02:49,916 --> 00:02:51,791
<i>Flying, flying far away</i>

38
00:02:51,875 --> 00:02:54,000
<i>She lost her way and went astray</i>

39
00:02:54,083 --> 00:02:56,166
<i>On a branch, all alone</i>

40
00:02:56,250 --> 00:02:58,250
<i>No friend to call her own</i>

41
00:02:58,333 --> 00:03:00,666
<i>Then another came, laughing by</i>

42
00:03:00,750 --> 00:03:03,666
<i>Ho, ho, swallow</i>
<i>Ho, ho, swallow</i>

43
00:03:03,750 --> 00:03:05,833
<i>Burst herself up there so high</i>

44
00:03:05,916 --> 00:03:08,041
<i>Hello, swallow Hello, swallow</i>

45
00:03:08,125 --> 00:03:10,333
<i>Little friends, where did they fly?</i>

46
00:03:10,416 --> 00:03:12,958
<i>…ready for departure…</i>

47
00:03:13,041 --> 00:03:15,791
<i>Little friends, where did they fly?</i>

48
00:03:15,875 --> 00:03:17,291
Mishty?

49
00:03:17,375 --> 00:03:18,875
<i>…and take care of your belongings.</i>

50
00:03:18,958 --> 00:03:20,000
Mishty?

51
00:03:34,583 --> 00:03:36,083
Mishty. Mi--

52
00:03:38,583 --> 00:03:39,458
Mishty!

53
00:03:41,083 --> 00:03:43,708
-Mishty! Mishty!
-Where are you going?

54
00:03:44,333 --> 00:03:47,166
-Mamma!
-Stop that woman! She's taking my child.

55
00:03:47,250 --> 00:03:48,708
Wait!

56
00:03:48,791 --> 00:03:49,708
Mishty!

57
00:03:49,791 --> 00:03:50,875
Watch out! Where are you going?

58
00:03:50,958 --> 00:03:52,791
Mishty! Mishty! Mishty!

59
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,416
Get away! Help, please!

60
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:58,375
-Help me!
-Mishty! Someone stop her!

61
00:04:01,166 --> 00:04:02,333
Mamma!

62
00:04:06,333 --> 00:04:07,416
Mishty!

63
00:04:08,250 --> 00:04:09,250
Mamma!

64
00:04:10,041 --> 00:04:11,208
Mishty.

65
00:04:11,291 --> 00:04:12,833
Mamma.

66
00:04:15,083 --> 00:04:16,208
Mishty!

67
00:04:20,291 --> 00:04:21,208
Bani!

68
00:04:22,375 --> 00:04:23,375
What happened?

69
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,375
Say something, Bani!

70
00:04:27,375 --> 00:04:28,416
Bani!

71
00:04:29,125 --> 00:04:30,458
Can you hear me, Bani?

72
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:32,791
Where's Mishty?

73
00:04:33,916 --> 00:04:34,916
Bani!

74
00:04:48,375 --> 00:04:50,291
Slow down, Bani, slow down. Wait.

75
00:04:50,375 --> 00:04:51,791
-This way.
-Yeah.

76
00:04:53,708 --> 00:04:55,791
Sir, someone's kidnapped my daughter, sir.

77
00:04:55,875 --> 00:04:57,250
This way.

78
00:04:57,333 --> 00:04:59,666
-Sit here, Bani. I'll tell him.
-Careful, careful.

79
00:04:59,750 --> 00:05:01,791
A woman kidnapped my daughter
from the train station.

80
00:05:01,875 --> 00:05:03,125
Please do something, sir.

81
00:05:03,208 --> 00:05:04,875
-Can you describe her?
-Bani.

82
00:05:04,958 --> 00:05:07,000
Yeah, yeah. Pur-pur-pur-purple--

83
00:05:07,083 --> 00:05:08,375
She was wearing a purple saree.

84
00:05:08,458 --> 00:05:09,708
Her head was covered. I…

85
00:05:09,791 --> 00:05:11,625
-I couldn't see her face.
-Did you get into a fight?

86
00:05:11,708 --> 00:05:14,958
No, sir. We don't even live here.
We were going to Gomati for a holiday.

87
00:05:15,041 --> 00:05:17,541
I got off for two minutes
to buy green mangoes for my daughter,

88
00:05:17,625 --> 00:05:18,916
and that's when all this happened.

89
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,083
I was too far away
to be able to catch the woman.

90
00:05:21,166 --> 00:05:23,083
-Okay. Details, quickly, officer.
-Please, sir.

91
00:05:23,166 --> 00:05:24,166
Tell him everything.

92
00:05:24,250 --> 00:05:26,208
-But before that, get them first aid.
-But, sir…

93
00:05:26,291 --> 00:05:28,125
-Okay. Later.
-Sir, please try and understand.

94
00:05:28,208 --> 00:05:30,333
-Listen to me, sir, it's been two hours…
-We'll look into it.

95
00:05:30,416 --> 00:05:32,041
-Don't worry.
-They'll do something to her.

96
00:05:32,125 --> 00:05:33,250
Sir, I beg of you.

97
00:05:33,333 --> 00:05:34,708
-Sir, please. Sir!
-Gokul?

98
00:05:35,833 --> 00:05:37,083
Where did the officer go?

99
00:05:43,375 --> 00:05:44,708
Can you see anything?

100
00:05:45,875 --> 00:05:46,708
No.

101
00:05:47,458 --> 00:05:49,166
Nurse, get the dressing done, please.

102
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,750
Come. This way.

103
00:05:53,291 --> 00:05:55,083
It's a trauma-related injury.

104
00:05:55,166 --> 00:05:58,333
And an internal hemorrhage has caused

105
00:05:58,416 --> 00:06:00,958
temporary blindness in both eyes.

106
00:06:01,041 --> 00:06:03,875
She'll be fine
with some rest and medication.

107
00:06:03,958 --> 00:06:06,833
But not sure how long
before she can see again.

108
00:06:11,666 --> 00:06:12,625
Gokul.

109
00:06:12,708 --> 00:06:14,458
Gokul, please ask him again.

110
00:06:14,541 --> 00:06:15,875
It's been six hours, Gokul.

111
00:06:15,958 --> 00:06:17,833
Please ask them where is my daughter.

112
00:06:18,875 --> 00:06:20,666
We're just waiting around, Gokul.

113
00:06:21,625 --> 00:06:22,666
Please go.

114
00:06:22,750 --> 00:06:25,000
Why don't you ask them again?
Are you listening?

115
00:06:25,083 --> 00:06:26,000
Sir, listen to me.

116
00:06:26,791 --> 00:06:29,125
It's been six hours
since we filed a report for my daughter.

117
00:06:29,208 --> 00:06:30,541
-Is there any update?
-Oh, yes.

118
00:06:30,625 --> 00:06:33,041
Uh, look, your daughter's pictures
have been sent

119
00:06:33,125 --> 00:06:34,583
to all the nearby police stations.

120
00:06:34,666 --> 00:06:37,500
Uh, we should be getting an update
in a few hours.

121
00:06:37,583 --> 00:06:38,833
-Can you please help me?
-Gokul!

122
00:06:39,875 --> 00:06:42,333
Take me there
and let me ask them if you can't.

123
00:06:42,416 --> 00:06:45,291
It's been… It's been a while.
Why aren't they telling us anything?

124
00:06:45,375 --> 00:06:47,666
Please go and sit down.
I'm writing a report.

125
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:49,500
Please understand the urgency
of the situation.

126
00:06:49,583 --> 00:06:50,541
Please go and sit.

127
00:06:50,625 --> 00:06:53,625
You sitting on my head
won't solve anything, hmm?

128
00:06:53,708 --> 00:06:55,791
Go and tell the officer that

129
00:06:55,875 --> 00:06:57,875
the woman was running
on platform number six.

130
00:06:57,958 --> 00:06:59,041
Bani.

131
00:06:59,625 --> 00:07:01,791
-She's been hurt badly on her head.
-Really, sir?

132
00:07:01,875 --> 00:07:03,541
A while back, we asked her what happened--

133
00:07:03,625 --> 00:07:05,250
Apparently, if a child isn't found

134
00:07:05,333 --> 00:07:06,791
in 48 hours, then, uh,

135
00:07:06,875 --> 00:07:08,791
most likely, they're never found.

136
00:07:09,416 --> 00:07:10,958
Really feeling sorry for them.

137
00:07:16,375 --> 00:07:17,208
No.

138
00:07:18,166 --> 00:07:19,250
No, no.

139
00:07:33,291 --> 00:07:36,041
<i>Tiny little swallow Cute little swallow</i>

140
00:07:37,875 --> 00:07:40,708
<i>Flying, flying far away</i>

141
00:07:40,791 --> 00:07:44,375
<i>She lost her way and went astray</i>

142
00:07:50,833 --> 00:07:53,208
JOYPURRA POLICE

143
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:11,500
-Hey?
-Ah.

144
00:08:11,583 --> 00:08:13,250
-You're still sitting here?
-Sir.

145
00:08:13,333 --> 00:08:15,000
It's really late. Please go home.

146
00:08:15,083 --> 00:08:16,958
-You two please leave!
-Tell me what's happening, sir.

147
00:08:17,041 --> 00:08:18,375
Sir?

148
00:08:22,541 --> 00:08:24,208
My daughter, where is she, sir?

149
00:08:31,875 --> 00:08:33,083
Please eat this, sir.

150
00:08:33,166 --> 00:08:34,000
Um…

151
00:08:34,083 --> 00:08:35,041
Please eat something.

152
00:08:35,625 --> 00:08:36,500
Thank you.

153
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,250
Here, Bani. Eat something.

154
00:08:39,875 --> 00:08:41,000
No.

155
00:08:41,083 --> 00:08:43,541
<i>You're a blessing from the Lord</i>
<i>My darling</i>

156
00:09:01,791 --> 00:09:07,833
<i>For a smile of yours</i>

157
00:09:13,833 --> 00:09:18,250
<i>I can sacrifice</i>

158
00:09:18,333 --> 00:09:23,083
<i>The whole world</i>

159
00:09:31,291 --> 00:09:33,250
Hey! What the h--

160
00:09:35,250 --> 00:09:37,041
The officer is coming this way.
I'll talk to him.

161
00:09:37,125 --> 00:09:38,000
Okay.

162
00:09:38,083 --> 00:09:39,875
Pandey, hurry up. Give me a cup of tea.

163
00:09:40,958 --> 00:09:42,750
-Sir…
-Come on, hurry up, please.

164
00:09:42,833 --> 00:09:43,750
Wait, wait, just a moment.

165
00:09:43,833 --> 00:09:45,375
-There's no news of my daughter.
-Cream roll.

166
00:09:45,458 --> 00:09:47,875
-Can you talk to the senior officer?
-Forget about the senior officer.

167
00:09:47,958 --> 00:09:49,875
His boss has arrived
at the station. Kabir.

168
00:09:49,958 --> 00:09:52,333
-Now go sit down.
-Please let me talk to the senior officer.

169
00:09:52,416 --> 00:09:54,166
All right, all right. I'll speak to him.

170
00:09:55,916 --> 00:09:58,791
Attention, everyone, please.
Kabir sir will conduct a special briefing.

171
00:09:58,875 --> 00:10:00,583
Sir…

172
00:10:00,666 --> 00:10:02,416
No, thank you.
I don't drink tea.

173
00:10:11,791 --> 00:10:14,625
This is the third case of abduction
in Joypurra this month.

174
00:10:16,291 --> 00:10:18,708
First, a six-year-old girl gets abducted
from a bus station.

175
00:10:34,416 --> 00:10:36,583
-Where is Shalini? Where did she go?
-Huh?

176
00:10:36,666 --> 00:10:38,000
-Tell me.
-My girl.

177
00:10:38,083 --> 00:10:40,083
-Where's our daughter? Our child!
-Our daughter!

178
00:10:41,958 --> 00:10:44,125
<i>That too in broad daylight in public view.</i>

179
00:10:44,958 --> 00:10:48,208
Then from the outskirts,
another six-year-old abducted.

180
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:52,041
-Where are you? I've been waiting for you.
-Mamma! Boo-hoo.

181
00:10:53,250 --> 00:10:54,875
Tell me, have you taken the sweets?

182
00:10:59,000 --> 00:10:59,875
Asmita!

183
00:11:02,375 --> 00:11:03,583
Asmita!

184
00:11:04,375 --> 00:11:05,416
Asmita!

185
00:11:11,458 --> 00:11:12,583
And yesterday,

186
00:11:12,666 --> 00:11:13,958
from the train station,

187
00:11:14,041 --> 00:11:15,958
another five-year-old girl abducted.

188
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:28,875
I want to know
what have you been able to find out

189
00:11:28,958 --> 00:11:30,083
about these kidnappings?

190
00:11:30,583 --> 00:11:31,625
Um…

191
00:11:32,375 --> 00:11:33,750
Sir, we're doing our best.

192
00:11:34,625 --> 00:11:37,541
I mean, friends, family, enemies,

193
00:11:37,625 --> 00:11:38,833
we're questioning everyone.

194
00:11:39,375 --> 00:11:42,416
But honestly, sir,
I find it very difficult to understand

195
00:11:42,500 --> 00:11:47,041
why would such senior officers like you
be sent here for a few kidnappings.

196
00:11:49,083 --> 00:11:52,375
This case is beyond
just a few kidnappings, Mr. Saha.

197
00:11:53,083 --> 00:11:56,166
For you, it might just be
three separate kidnappings,

198
00:11:56,250 --> 00:11:58,625
but all of these are interlinked.

199
00:11:58,708 --> 00:12:00,708
And that is why I was sent here.

200
00:12:17,375 --> 00:12:19,625
This is part
of a massive sex trafficking racket.

201
00:12:20,458 --> 00:12:24,125
In 2023, India had more than
80,000 cases of abduction.

202
00:12:24,208 --> 00:12:28,166
And a major part of it
was of the sex trafficking of minors.

203
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,250
Now most of these kids

204
00:12:31,333 --> 00:12:34,291
where taken from the East Coast
and its surrounding areas.

205
00:12:36,166 --> 00:12:38,833
We know that there are two things common
to these kidnappings.

206
00:12:39,625 --> 00:12:41,708
First, that all the girls
that were kidnapped

207
00:12:41,791 --> 00:12:43,625
are younger than six years of age.

208
00:12:44,375 --> 00:12:48,291
And second, they're the daughters
of helpless low-class parents.

209
00:12:50,125 --> 00:12:52,833
There is an increased demand
for these girls in the flesh trade.

210
00:12:52,916 --> 00:12:56,375
So it is very important for us to find out
how they're doing it.

211
00:12:56,458 --> 00:12:58,125
What's the modus operandi?

212
00:12:58,208 --> 00:13:00,625
How and from where are they being smuggled
out of the country?

213
00:13:03,666 --> 00:13:06,458
Now the border towns of the East Coast
and its surrounding areas

214
00:13:06,541 --> 00:13:08,750
are going to be the focus
of our investigation.

215
00:13:10,708 --> 00:13:12,583
To begin with, we need network.

216
00:13:12,666 --> 00:13:14,416
Only then, can we investigate.

217
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:16,916
Hmm.

218
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:17,958
Mr. Kallol.

219
00:13:19,166 --> 00:13:20,958
IT departments of all other cities

220
00:13:21,041 --> 00:13:23,500
have submitted
their updated surveillance reports.

221
00:13:23,583 --> 00:13:25,791
But Joypurra's department hasn't.
May I know why?

222
00:13:25,875 --> 00:13:26,750
Sir.

223
00:13:27,791 --> 00:13:30,166
They must have a pretty strong network.

224
00:13:30,250 --> 00:13:31,791
Not like ours.

225
00:13:32,791 --> 00:13:34,625
Uh, it's in process though.

226
00:13:35,708 --> 00:13:36,541
Sir.

227
00:13:36,625 --> 00:13:39,666
We have ensured to cover
each and every route

228
00:13:39,750 --> 00:13:41,583
leading out of Joypurra. Yeah?

229
00:13:44,083 --> 00:13:44,916
Good.

230
00:13:45,791 --> 00:13:47,166
Barricade these areas.

231
00:13:47,250 --> 00:13:50,750
And I want every exit from Joypurra
to be sealed immediately.

232
00:13:50,833 --> 00:13:51,666
Got it?

233
00:13:52,500 --> 00:13:53,416
After you, sir.

234
00:14:00,458 --> 00:14:01,291
Thank you.

235
00:14:01,833 --> 00:14:03,083
You may get back to your work.

236
00:14:10,208 --> 00:14:13,250
Joypurra is not
everyone's cup of tea, sir.

237
00:14:13,333 --> 00:14:14,500
Remember that.

238
00:14:20,916 --> 00:14:22,083
Uh, how much?

239
00:14:22,166 --> 00:14:23,958
You can pay me later
once you find your daughter.

240
00:14:24,041 --> 00:14:25,208
Thank you.

241
00:14:27,291 --> 00:14:28,583
Sir, my daughter is missing.

242
00:14:29,583 --> 00:14:31,500
-Give me few, please.
-Come. Hey.

243
00:14:32,916 --> 00:14:34,083
-Careful. I'm going in.
-Yes.

244
00:14:34,166 --> 00:14:35,541
-Sir.
-That's my daughter.

245
00:14:35,625 --> 00:14:37,708
If any of you see her,
please call this number.

246
00:14:38,916 --> 00:14:39,958
-Stay right here.
-Okay.

247
00:14:40,041 --> 00:14:42,166
-My daughter's kidnapped.
-Please wait.

248
00:14:42,250 --> 00:14:44,208
Please, please help me find my daughter.

249
00:14:46,541 --> 00:14:48,166
This is my daughter. Have you seen her?

250
00:14:49,666 --> 00:14:52,125
If you find her, call this number, please.

251
00:15:01,041 --> 00:15:03,416
My daughter was kidnapped
from the railway station yesterday.

252
00:15:05,958 --> 00:15:08,583
{\an8}We've been looking for her.
And the police aren't doing much.

253
00:15:08,666 --> 00:15:11,916
{\an8}If you get to know anything,
please can you call me on this number?

254
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:15,208
There is an NGO and shelter home
for children nearby.

255
00:15:15,291 --> 00:15:16,500
Shishukal.

256
00:15:16,583 --> 00:15:18,166
Perhaps, they might be able to help.

257
00:15:22,500 --> 00:15:25,083
-Sorry. Sorry.
-Bani!

258
00:15:26,250 --> 00:15:27,250
Sorry.

259
00:15:27,333 --> 00:15:29,958
I dropped them. I dropped them.
I dropped them.

260
00:15:30,041 --> 00:15:32,166
-I dropped them. I dropped them.
-Bani!

261
00:15:32,250 --> 00:15:34,875
-Gokul, I dropped them, Gokul.
-Bani!

262
00:15:34,958 --> 00:15:36,250
They took her away.

263
00:15:46,291 --> 00:15:50,000
<i>Runaway, abducted, or missing.</i>

264
00:15:50,083 --> 00:15:53,333
This place has information
on all these children.

265
00:15:55,208 --> 00:15:57,541
Please leave
your daughter's picture with us.

266
00:15:58,458 --> 00:16:00,375
I'll get the form for you both.

267
00:16:00,458 --> 00:16:02,708
We need to know everything about her.

268
00:16:02,791 --> 00:16:04,833
Please fill it correctly, all right?

269
00:16:07,333 --> 00:16:08,708
Don't worry.

270
00:16:08,791 --> 00:16:11,958
City of Joypurra's blessed
by the Goddess Chaumukhi.

271
00:16:12,041 --> 00:16:14,375
Your daughter will return to you safely.

272
00:16:20,541 --> 00:16:22,375
Sir.

273
00:16:22,458 --> 00:16:25,875
The train station and toll checkpoint,
both had just one gate operational.

274
00:16:25,958 --> 00:16:27,666
<i>The rest have been shut down.</i>

275
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:30,458
<i>In keeping with</i>
<i>our threat assessment reports,</i>

276
00:16:30,541 --> 00:16:32,333
<i>we have increased security everywhere.</i>

277
00:16:32,416 --> 00:16:34,958
<i>Twenty-four-seven</i>
<i>camera surveillance is on.</i>

278
00:16:35,041 --> 00:16:38,708
<i>Special forces are present</i>
<i>on every route leading out of the city.</i>

279
00:16:38,791 --> 00:16:42,125
Now it's impossible
for the girls to be taken out of Joypurra.

280
00:16:42,208 --> 00:16:44,666
What about the underground
drug smuggling routes?

281
00:16:45,291 --> 00:16:47,333
Let me explain. Look.

282
00:16:48,166 --> 00:16:50,208
With the help of drones and GPR,

283
00:16:50,291 --> 00:16:54,708
your JSF have conducted
an anti-tunnelling operation.

284
00:16:54,791 --> 00:16:56,625
As you can see in the video,

285
00:16:56,708 --> 00:16:58,583
{\an8}all the tunnels are shut.

286
00:16:58,666 --> 00:17:03,625
{\an8}And all the tunnels that are shut
have been sealed off officially.

287
00:17:03,708 --> 00:17:05,041
Madam is absolutely right.

288
00:17:06,291 --> 00:17:08,083
Mark my words.

289
00:17:08,166 --> 00:17:10,375
Uh, forget about the girls,

290
00:17:11,208 --> 00:17:13,458
even an ant can't leave Joypurra.

291
00:17:13,541 --> 00:17:15,000
Is this confirmed?

292
00:17:15,083 --> 00:17:16,708
-Sir, uh…
-I repeat.

293
00:17:17,333 --> 00:17:20,041
Even an ant can't leave Joypurra.

294
00:17:23,916 --> 00:17:25,916
Train halted at the platform.

295
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:28,250
Gokul had gone to get green mango.

296
00:17:28,333 --> 00:17:29,875
Mishty wanted to go to the bathroom.

297
00:17:29,958 --> 00:17:30,958
Then I went in.

298
00:17:31,041 --> 00:17:33,833
I asked her to stand right there
for just two minutes.

299
00:17:33,916 --> 00:17:35,208
She was standing right outside.

300
00:17:35,291 --> 00:17:37,208
-I told her she was… She was…
-Bani.

301
00:17:37,291 --> 00:17:38,375
Have some tea, Bani.

302
00:17:38,458 --> 00:17:40,041
She was singing the Swallow song…

303
00:17:40,125 --> 00:17:42,208
-Bani.
-She was singing the Swallow song with me.

304
00:17:42,291 --> 00:17:43,125
And we were doing it--

305
00:17:43,208 --> 00:17:44,833
It's been two days
you haven't eaten anything.

306
00:17:44,916 --> 00:17:46,208
At least have some tea, Bani.

307
00:17:46,291 --> 00:17:48,750
She was reciting it for me…
I should have taken her inside.

308
00:17:48,833 --> 00:17:50,791
I shouldn't have…
I shouldn't have left her outside.

309
00:17:50,875 --> 00:17:52,041
-I shouldn't have--
-Bani.

310
00:17:52,125 --> 00:17:54,083
-I don't know how I could be so careless.
-Bani!

311
00:17:54,166 --> 00:17:55,125
It's my fault. I shouldn't…

312
00:17:55,208 --> 00:17:56,541
Get a grip. We'll find her.

313
00:17:56,625 --> 00:17:57,791
Tell me how, Gokul?

314
00:17:57,875 --> 00:18:00,708
It's been more than 24 hours,
and we're just sitting here.

315
00:18:00,791 --> 00:18:02,875
What have you been able to do? Huh?

316
00:18:02,958 --> 00:18:04,916
-And this thing is so frustrating.
-Bani!

317
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,166
What are you doing?

318
00:18:06,791 --> 00:18:08,750
What's wrong with you?

319
00:18:11,791 --> 00:18:13,708
How we're going to find Mishty?

320
00:18:13,791 --> 00:18:15,375
We can't just be sitting around here.

321
00:18:15,458 --> 00:18:17,625
You think those officers
are going to find her?

322
00:18:17,708 --> 00:18:19,500
Those guys, they don't even talk to us.

323
00:18:20,583 --> 00:18:23,041
I just want my daughter back.

324
00:18:23,125 --> 00:18:24,791
Bring me my Mishty, Gokul.

325
00:18:24,875 --> 00:18:26,666
-Bring me my Mishty!
-What do you mean, "My Mishty"?

326
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:28,291
She is my daughter too. I'll find her!

327
00:18:28,375 --> 00:18:29,916
Go and find her then!

328
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,000
Get my daughter back in here! Huh?

329
00:18:32,875 --> 00:18:34,458
We couldn't protect her, Gokul.

330
00:18:35,166 --> 00:18:36,958
You couldn't protect your daughter.

331
00:18:38,375 --> 00:18:41,833
What condition she might be in,
what kind of people she might be with!

332
00:18:43,166 --> 00:18:46,291
She… She must be waiting hoping
that her parents will come find her.

333
00:18:46,375 --> 00:18:48,500
And look at her parents
just sitting around.

334
00:18:52,916 --> 00:18:54,375
Just bring my daughter back.

335
00:18:54,958 --> 00:18:56,250
Whatever it takes.

336
00:18:56,916 --> 00:18:57,958
I don't care.

337
00:18:58,041 --> 00:18:59,375
Just bring me my daughter.

338
00:19:01,083 --> 00:19:02,208
Bring her back now.

339
00:19:02,291 --> 00:19:03,416
Bring my Mishty back.

340
00:19:04,333 --> 00:19:07,291
My Mishty…
Please bring my Mishty back to me.

341
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:10,250
I want my Mishty.

342
00:19:12,583 --> 00:19:14,875
I want my Mishty, Gokul.

343
00:19:17,625 --> 00:19:19,375
I'm going back to train station now.

344
00:19:20,750 --> 00:19:23,791
Hopefully, this time,
I'll be able to find out something more.

345
00:19:24,791 --> 00:19:26,583
You wait here for me. I'll be back.

346
00:19:42,708 --> 00:19:43,958
You wanted to see me?

347
00:19:44,833 --> 00:19:45,708
Yeah.

348
00:19:46,291 --> 00:19:47,541
Sanjukta.

349
00:19:47,625 --> 00:19:49,291
We've been tipped off
by the local intelligence.

350
00:19:50,291 --> 00:19:52,125
And, uh, as per our sources…

351
00:19:52,958 --> 00:19:53,833
Uh, good evening, sir.

352
00:19:58,833 --> 00:19:59,791
Come.

353
00:19:59,875 --> 00:20:01,125
<i>As per our sources,</i>

354
00:20:02,041 --> 00:20:04,125
this is the gang we've dealt with before.

355
00:20:04,833 --> 00:20:05,833
The Blackhole.

356
00:20:07,708 --> 00:20:09,041
And that's the same gang

357
00:20:09,125 --> 00:20:11,041
which was smuggling girls
out of the country

358
00:20:11,125 --> 00:20:12,583
from the Fanapur border five years ago.

359
00:20:12,666 --> 00:20:14,000
Exactly.

360
00:20:14,083 --> 00:20:15,916
At that time, we were onto them.

361
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:18,916
Through phone calls,
bank transfers, social media.

362
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:21,541
But the moment they realized
we're after them,

363
00:20:22,083 --> 00:20:24,791
they shut down the operation
and vanished completely.

364
00:20:24,875 --> 00:20:25,833
We couldn't--

365
00:20:43,083 --> 00:20:45,583
But this time,
they're playing it differently.

366
00:20:47,458 --> 00:20:49,750
They are not leaving
any digital footprint.

367
00:20:50,500 --> 00:20:52,333
And according to our intel,

368
00:20:52,833 --> 00:20:55,333
a huge consignment of these poor girls

369
00:20:55,416 --> 00:20:57,625
will leave the country
in a month and half.

370
00:20:57,708 --> 00:20:58,583
From a border town.

371
00:20:58,666 --> 00:21:00,708
-Spicy puffed rice!
-So, there's a great chance

372
00:21:00,791 --> 00:21:03,125
that until then
these girls will be kept hidden,

373
00:21:03,750 --> 00:21:06,166
-possibly in nearby areas.
-Spicy puffed rice!

374
00:21:06,250 --> 00:21:10,291
We just need to figure out
which border town is it going to be.

375
00:21:10,375 --> 00:21:12,375
Spicy puffed rice!

376
00:21:18,333 --> 00:21:19,791
Dutta Sir!

377
00:21:19,875 --> 00:21:21,541
Spicy puffed rice!

378
00:21:22,708 --> 00:21:24,833
Take it or the monkeys will steal it.

379
00:21:32,625 --> 00:21:34,458
Sir, spicy puffed rice.

380
00:21:35,041 --> 00:21:36,500
Spicy puffed rice!

381
00:21:39,166 --> 00:21:41,000
Be very careful, Sanjukta.

382
00:21:41,833 --> 00:21:44,541
Every corner of this place
is infested with snakes.

383
00:21:49,375 --> 00:21:51,833
And the criminals
could even be in uniform.

384
00:21:58,125 --> 00:22:00,333
Dada Bhai, the new officer is a tough one.

385
00:22:00,416 --> 00:22:02,208
He has increased the security everywhere.

386
00:22:02,291 --> 00:22:04,708
Do you think we should delay
the consignment of girls a little?

387
00:22:09,458 --> 00:22:12,541
The girls will leave
in a month and a half.

388
00:22:14,291 --> 00:22:17,416
Make sure you're ready with Plan Zero.

389
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:25,208
A cup of tea.

390
00:22:50,958 --> 00:22:51,875
Liliya.

391
00:22:51,958 --> 00:22:54,000
Liliya, my dear.

392
00:22:54,083 --> 00:22:58,125
You were only six when I began
teaching you acrobatic tricks.

393
00:22:58,208 --> 00:23:00,625
But I never taught you to give up.

394
00:23:00,708 --> 00:23:01,625
Jhunu Amba?

395
00:23:04,500 --> 00:23:08,041
A defeated mother cannot be my daughter.

396
00:23:08,833 --> 00:23:10,375
That's not my Liliya.

397
00:23:14,583 --> 00:23:15,708
Jhunu Amba.

398
00:23:18,791 --> 00:23:21,916
They took away my daughter
from me, Jhunu Amba.

399
00:23:23,416 --> 00:23:24,833
They took her away.

400
00:23:26,833 --> 00:23:28,875
They took her away
right in front of my eyes,

401
00:23:28,958 --> 00:23:30,458
and I stood there helpless.

402
00:23:33,250 --> 00:23:34,666
Why my Mishty?

403
00:23:36,291 --> 00:23:38,625
My daughter, my little swallow.

404
00:23:44,208 --> 00:23:45,625
They took her away.

405
00:23:45,708 --> 00:23:47,416
Life is a chain of events.

406
00:23:48,416 --> 00:23:52,416
The past, the present and the future
are all connected.

407
00:23:52,500 --> 00:23:54,833
Seven years ago,
when you left Chaksuliyapada

408
00:23:54,916 --> 00:23:57,750
and went to the city
to perform acrobatics,

409
00:23:59,750 --> 00:24:02,791
my granddaughter, Dulari,
was kidnapped by some people.

410
00:24:03,583 --> 00:24:06,000
For years I looked for her,
but I couldn't find her.

411
00:24:07,458 --> 00:24:10,750
Just two years ago,
I got to know about a gang…

412
00:24:10,833 --> 00:24:12,625
A gang by the name of Blackhole.

413
00:24:13,958 --> 00:24:15,833
She was kidnapped by them.

414
00:24:16,750 --> 00:24:20,000
With great difficulty,
after connecting the dots,

415
00:24:20,083 --> 00:24:21,750
I've arrived here.

416
00:24:21,833 --> 00:24:23,291
G… Gang?

417
00:24:24,958 --> 00:24:26,750
My… My Mishty.

418
00:24:26,833 --> 00:24:28,166
My Mishty was kidnapped by…

419
00:24:28,250 --> 00:24:31,375
-Pull yourself together, Liliya.
-They took my Mishty.

420
00:24:33,041 --> 00:24:34,791
It's believed that centuries ago,

421
00:24:34,875 --> 00:24:38,041
there lived a demon here
by the name of Magrasur.

422
00:24:38,833 --> 00:24:41,916
He kidnapped children
and took them to the netherworld.

423
00:24:43,375 --> 00:24:44,250
To save them,

424
00:24:44,333 --> 00:24:48,291
Chaumukhi the goddess of this land herself
descended into the netherworld.

425
00:24:50,041 --> 00:24:54,166
She tore open Magrasur's belly
and freed those children.

426
00:24:54,250 --> 00:24:56,000
-How…
-Keep the faith.

427
00:24:57,583 --> 00:24:59,250
-How would she…
-Be strong.

428
00:25:01,333 --> 00:25:03,250
What condition must she be in?

429
00:25:03,333 --> 00:25:04,333
Liliya.

430
00:25:04,416 --> 00:25:07,125
-Has she eaten anything at all?
-Liliya.

431
00:25:08,416 --> 00:25:10,416
Listen to me very carefully.

432
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:14,500
We are going to find your daughter Mishty.

433
00:25:14,583 --> 00:25:17,875
I had overheard an officer
at the police station.

434
00:25:17,958 --> 00:25:20,291
He mentioned that this gang
keeps girls hidden

435
00:25:20,375 --> 00:25:22,541
in Joypurra and its neighboring areas.

436
00:25:22,625 --> 00:25:25,916
They plan to smuggle them out of here
in about four to six weeks.

437
00:25:26,708 --> 00:25:28,791
Mishty could be one of those girls.

438
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:32,833
You need to stay here
and fight these demons.

439
00:25:39,250 --> 00:25:43,041
One… One thing I'm sure of, Jhunu Amba.

440
00:25:44,666 --> 00:25:48,333
Until I get my daughter back,
I will not leave Joypurra.

441
00:25:49,875 --> 00:25:52,750
For that,
you'll have to first hide your fears,

442
00:25:54,291 --> 00:25:56,208
and get to know this city well.

443
00:25:58,291 --> 00:26:00,125
<i>To save your Mishty,</i>

444
00:26:00,875 --> 00:26:03,458
{\an8}<i>you will have to become</i>
<i>a part of this city.</i>

445
00:26:04,458 --> 00:26:06,583
{\an8}<i>Just like I have become.</i>

446
00:26:37,125 --> 00:26:38,583
Hello, Bani ma'am.

447
00:26:38,666 --> 00:26:40,000
Please settle your laundry bills.

448
00:26:40,083 --> 00:26:41,833
I need to see my money quickly.

449
00:26:42,375 --> 00:26:43,958
Tomorrow. Don't bother me right now.

450
00:26:45,500 --> 00:26:47,041
Love you too, Bani ma'am!

451
00:26:48,750 --> 00:26:49,625
Nishi!

452
00:26:49,708 --> 00:26:50,833
Nishi!

453
00:26:51,583 --> 00:26:53,041
Nishi, slow down!

454
00:26:53,125 --> 00:26:55,166
Wait, you'll hurt yourself.

455
00:26:56,833 --> 00:27:00,500
Bani ma'am, tell me,
how did you see me again?

456
00:27:08,666 --> 00:27:11,000
Ma'am, hurry up. We will get late.

457
00:27:11,083 --> 00:27:13,041
Come, ma'am, come. Hurry up.

458
00:27:14,875 --> 00:27:15,750
Up.

459
00:27:16,541 --> 00:27:17,708
And down.

460
00:27:19,750 --> 00:27:20,875
Up.

461
00:27:22,125 --> 00:27:23,208
And down.

462
00:27:28,333 --> 00:27:29,166
Nisha,

463
00:27:29,708 --> 00:27:31,041
up to your tricks again?

464
00:27:31,125 --> 00:27:33,833
Sorry, ma'am. I have eaten the candy.

465
00:27:33,916 --> 00:27:34,916
Sorry.

466
00:27:43,958 --> 00:27:46,250
Left. Right.

467
00:27:46,333 --> 00:27:48,750
Left. Right.

468
00:27:48,833 --> 00:27:51,833
Left. Right. Left…

469
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:55,833
Nisha?

470
00:27:56,500 --> 00:27:58,000
Nisha? What's wrong?

471
00:27:58,083 --> 00:28:00,375
Bani ma'am,
I think she has got food poisoning.

472
00:28:00,458 --> 00:28:03,083
I'll take her to Joypurra General Hospital
to get some medicines.

473
00:28:03,166 --> 00:28:06,500
You know, she's not going
to be eating any more junk food.

474
00:28:06,583 --> 00:28:08,458
-Come on, let's go, Nishi.
-What… What did she eat?

475
00:28:08,541 --> 00:28:10,708
How many times have I told you
not to eat junk food?

476
00:28:12,416 --> 00:28:14,083
You please don't worry, Bani.

477
00:28:14,166 --> 00:28:15,458
Nisha will be fine very soon.

478
00:28:18,041 --> 00:28:20,541
"When love is in the air,
the heart bubbles."

479
00:28:20,625 --> 00:28:21,875
Hello, Uma.

480
00:28:26,291 --> 00:28:29,416
Last time, the filter
was not changed properly.

481
00:28:29,500 --> 00:28:31,916
That's why I thought I would come
and fix your purifier again.

482
00:28:33,541 --> 00:28:36,166
Even though, you didn't raise a complaint.

483
00:28:36,250 --> 00:28:37,666
Some water?

484
00:28:37,750 --> 00:28:39,958
Exactly what I have to fix.

485
00:28:40,041 --> 00:28:42,833
This isn't out of my love for the job,
but love for my neighbor.

486
00:28:50,375 --> 00:28:52,791
Is it done?

487
00:28:57,125 --> 00:28:58,000
Bani,

488
00:28:58,500 --> 00:29:01,250
your back must be hurting
from filling buckets of water, right?

489
00:29:03,791 --> 00:29:05,791
I need to leave for work.
It's getting late.

490
00:29:05,875 --> 00:29:07,541
All right, I'll see you soon.

491
00:29:09,708 --> 00:29:10,791
Even I'll be back soon.

492
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:17,000
Listen, Gokul. You're headed towards
the checkpoint, aren't you?

493
00:29:17,083 --> 00:29:18,416
Could you give me a ride, please?

494
00:29:18,500 --> 00:29:20,875
A month ago, three girls were abducted.

495
00:29:20,958 --> 00:29:22,625
Seems like the entire city's

496
00:29:22,708 --> 00:29:24,083
-under a curse.
-ID?

497
00:29:24,166 --> 00:29:26,083
-What?
-Go.

498
00:29:26,166 --> 00:29:27,125
But after coming here,

499
00:29:27,208 --> 00:29:28,916
the new senior officer has a done a lot

500
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:31,791
to tighten the security
in and around the city, isn't it?

501
00:29:31,875 --> 00:29:32,750
Right.

502
00:29:33,833 --> 00:29:35,583
Open the trunk and check it properly.

503
00:29:35,666 --> 00:29:38,416
-Wait, where are you going?
-What's your name? Let him go.

504
00:29:47,166 --> 00:29:49,625
Open the trunk. Hurry up and open it.

505
00:29:58,083 --> 00:29:59,583
-Let them go.
-You can go.

506
00:30:26,208 --> 00:30:29,250
Jhunu Amba, until I get my daughter back,

507
00:30:29,333 --> 00:30:31,666
I will not leave Joypurra.

508
00:30:31,750 --> 00:30:34,458
For that,
you'll have to first hide your fears.

509
00:30:34,541 --> 00:30:37,541
You will have to become
a part of this city.

510
00:30:38,791 --> 00:30:43,041
There is no one as fierce as a mother
when it comes to protecting her child.

511
00:30:44,375 --> 00:30:45,541
<i>Remember.</i>

512
00:30:45,625 --> 00:30:48,666
<i>As a child,</i>
<i>everyone would applaud your acrobatics</i>

513
00:30:48,750 --> 00:30:50,958
<i>because you preferred</i>
<i>to do it blindfolded.</i>

514
00:30:51,041 --> 00:30:52,916
My Liliya's not done yet!

515
00:30:53,916 --> 00:30:56,083
<i>You have the power to see with your ears.</i>

516
00:31:16,458 --> 00:31:20,750
<i>No one believes that</i>
<i>a blind woman can be dangerous.</i>

517
00:31:33,250 --> 00:31:34,958
<i>Your vision is getting better now.</i>

518
00:31:35,500 --> 00:31:39,208
<i>But to truly see Joypurra,</i>
<i>you will have to remain blind.</i>

519
00:31:48,291 --> 00:31:49,958
<i>Ma, </i>you couldn't find me.

520
00:31:50,833 --> 00:31:54,166
Your <i>ma </i>will always find you,
my little swallow.

521
00:31:54,250 --> 00:31:55,125
Always.

522
00:32:04,458 --> 00:32:08,000
<i>Remember,</i>
<i>Gokul shouldn't know any of this.</i>

523
00:32:08,083 --> 00:32:10,625
<i>If this demon called Blackhole</i>
<i>ever sets eyes on him,</i>

524
00:32:10,708 --> 00:32:12,000
<i>that will be the end of him.</i>

525
00:32:14,166 --> 00:32:15,666
<i>In the epic Mahabharat,</i>

526
00:32:15,750 --> 00:32:18,833
<i>Gandhari blindfolded herself</i>
<i>for her husband.</i>

527
00:32:18,916 --> 00:32:21,625
<i>You will blindfold yourself</i>
<i>to vanquish that demon</i>

528
00:32:21,708 --> 00:32:23,250
<i>for your daughter Mishty.</i>

529
00:32:44,166 --> 00:32:45,750
Something big is going to happen

530
00:32:45,833 --> 00:32:47,666
in the old warehouse of Dakkhinpara.

531
00:32:48,416 --> 00:32:51,291
Police security
has been removed from there.

532
00:32:51,375 --> 00:32:53,875
It's possible that the girls
have been kept there.

533
00:32:53,958 --> 00:32:55,708
We don't have much time.

534
00:32:55,791 --> 00:32:58,166
-The delivery was made a while ago.
-That's good.

535
00:32:58,250 --> 00:33:00,416
-Was everything accounted for?
-Oh, absolutely.

536
00:33:00,500 --> 00:33:01,375
Let's see.

537
00:33:01,458 --> 00:33:03,416
It's already being loaded
onto another truck.

538
00:33:03,500 --> 00:33:05,583
You don't worry about that.
I'll manage it.

539
00:33:05,666 --> 00:33:07,708
-I'll go and check. Hmm.
-Okay.

540
00:33:08,250 --> 00:33:10,041
Yeah, it's going to be a long…

541
00:33:10,125 --> 00:33:12,833
Don't worry.
I've already sent them the location.

542
00:33:32,416 --> 00:33:34,083
Yes, sir?

543
00:33:35,083 --> 00:33:36,625
We are just about to leave for Para Nagar.

544
00:33:39,416 --> 00:33:41,125
Everything's ready here.

545
00:33:51,333 --> 00:33:52,333
Hello?

546
00:33:52,416 --> 00:33:53,833
There's no issue.

547
00:34:29,958 --> 00:34:32,416
Got you! <i>Ma </i>couldn't find me.

548
00:34:32,500 --> 00:34:34,458
My little swallow.

549
00:34:42,541 --> 00:34:45,166
The girls may have been here
for a short while.

550
00:34:46,416 --> 00:34:49,791
Liliya, come on let's go. Come on.

551
00:34:50,708 --> 00:34:53,208
Sir, we were stationed
at the Devitalaganj Police Station.

552
00:34:53,291 --> 00:34:55,041
But we were tipped off
that an abducted girl

553
00:34:55,125 --> 00:34:56,708
was being taken away in a white van.

554
00:34:56,791 --> 00:34:58,291
Which has headed towards Joypurra.

555
00:34:58,375 --> 00:34:59,875
We are on our way back
to follow that lead.

556
00:34:59,958 --> 00:35:01,166
Yeah. Dutta, come in. Dutta!

557
00:35:01,250 --> 00:35:03,708
<i>Sir, turn left from Chaumukhi Square.</i>

558
00:35:03,791 --> 00:35:05,125
Sir.

559
00:35:06,208 --> 00:35:09,041
All right. Dutta.
Uh, we're taking the shortcut.

560
00:35:09,125 --> 00:35:10,666
You just stay on the tail.

561
00:35:10,750 --> 00:35:12,166
Huh? Stay on it. Stay on it.

562
00:35:16,666 --> 00:35:17,916
Sir. Dutta sir.

563
00:35:21,625 --> 00:35:22,875
Where is the girl?

564
00:35:23,583 --> 00:35:24,458
Sir…

565
00:35:27,083 --> 00:35:29,750
The kidnapped girl was transported
in this very van.

566
00:35:29,833 --> 00:35:32,208
Weren't you also tracking
the same van with us

567
00:35:32,291 --> 00:35:34,166
which was on its way from Devitalaganj?

568
00:35:35,333 --> 00:35:38,208
The number plate is the same as the van

569
00:35:38,291 --> 00:35:41,083
that crossed the Joypurra border
40 minutes earlier.

570
00:35:42,375 --> 00:35:46,208
But, uh, when we searched inside,
there were only vegetables in it.

571
00:35:46,750 --> 00:35:47,791
Only vegetables.

572
00:35:48,375 --> 00:35:50,833
There was an abduction report
filed two days ago.

573
00:35:50,916 --> 00:35:51,791
Where was it filed from?

574
00:35:51,875 --> 00:35:53,791
The one two days ago was from Dhoopanagar.

575
00:35:54,500 --> 00:35:56,625
So what's the distance between Joypurra--

576
00:35:56,708 --> 00:35:59,291
Uh, must be around 50 to 55 kilometers.

577
00:36:09,333 --> 00:36:11,625
Uh, go and check what's happening there.

578
00:36:16,083 --> 00:36:19,833
Not one girl has been kidnapped
from Joypurra in the last month.

579
00:36:20,541 --> 00:36:23,583
But instead, they're being kidnapped
from the neighboring areas.

580
00:36:23,666 --> 00:36:24,875
Uttamanagar.

581
00:36:26,250 --> 00:36:27,416
Dhoopanagar.

582
00:36:27,500 --> 00:36:28,625
Pakhandpur.

583
00:36:29,291 --> 00:36:30,458
Devitalaganj.

584
00:36:31,416 --> 00:36:32,416
Padmabari.

585
00:36:33,833 --> 00:36:38,000
However, all the abducted girls
were last seen in either Joypurra

586
00:36:38,083 --> 00:36:40,791
or the bordering areas of Joypurra.

587
00:36:45,375 --> 00:36:47,291
We have the answer to our question.

588
00:36:48,750 --> 00:36:51,125
This gang is mostly active
only in Joypurra.

589
00:36:53,375 --> 00:36:55,708
That means all the abducted girls

590
00:36:55,791 --> 00:36:58,291
are going to be smuggled out of Joypurra.

591
00:36:59,916 --> 00:37:02,125
Sanjukta, uh…

592
00:37:02,208 --> 00:37:05,875
All the roads which are leading
out of Joypurra are sealed, right?

593
00:37:06,583 --> 00:37:07,833
Yes, sir. They're all sealed.

594
00:37:07,916 --> 00:37:09,500
But there are a few trading routes

595
00:37:09,583 --> 00:37:11,208
which opened during the festival
of the goddess.

596
00:37:11,291 --> 00:37:15,458
For the import and export of incense,
lamps, idols and other things.

597
00:37:15,541 --> 00:37:17,750
They will open,
but under heavy surveillance.

598
00:37:18,958 --> 00:37:19,791
Right.

599
00:37:21,875 --> 00:37:24,916
So, it is possible
that they'll use the festival as a cover

600
00:37:25,875 --> 00:37:27,791
to get the girls out of Joypurra.

601
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:33,083
Sir, should we just
have the festival cancelled this year?

602
00:37:33,708 --> 00:37:34,750
We can't do that.

603
00:37:35,625 --> 00:37:39,833
The Bahurupi community have been granted
special rights by the government.

604
00:37:39,916 --> 00:37:41,333
We can't stop them.

605
00:37:42,166 --> 00:37:43,250
Um…

606
00:37:43,750 --> 00:37:45,041
Call him. What… What's his name?

607
00:37:45,125 --> 00:37:46,250
Sir, Mr. Dutta. Just a minute.

608
00:37:46,333 --> 00:37:47,458
Mr. Dutta!

609
00:37:48,375 --> 00:37:49,291
Yes, madam?

610
00:37:49,375 --> 00:37:51,375
Please come here for a minute.

611
00:37:51,958 --> 00:37:53,416
-Madam?
-Sir.

612
00:37:53,500 --> 00:37:56,333
For the festival next week,
what do you think are the trading routes?

613
00:37:56,416 --> 00:37:58,333
Sir, Kalpataru Nagar,

614
00:37:58,416 --> 00:38:01,500
Chaumukhi Chowk,
and, uh, the Joypurra docks.

615
00:38:01,583 --> 00:38:03,208
These are the important routes.

616
00:38:03,291 --> 00:38:05,375
And who is on police duty in these areas?

617
00:38:05,458 --> 00:38:06,750
Why, uh…

618
00:38:07,708 --> 00:38:08,916
Officer Saha.

619
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:12,125
Though the final duty chart
will be out only next week.

620
00:38:12,208 --> 00:38:13,666
Just before the festival.

621
00:38:16,416 --> 00:38:22,041
The good news is that the swelling
on your optic nerve has completely gone.

622
00:38:22,125 --> 00:38:25,041
But, uh,
is there any improvement in vision?

623
00:38:26,208 --> 00:38:27,041
No.

624
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:29,791
Uh, all right.

625
00:38:29,875 --> 00:38:32,041
I'll write a new prescription. Come.

626
00:38:37,750 --> 00:38:39,666
I'm changing the medicine.

627
00:38:39,750 --> 00:38:42,000
And in a month's time,
we'll run another test.

628
00:38:43,458 --> 00:38:45,541
And here are your reports.

629
00:38:47,291 --> 00:38:48,458
Thank you, doctor.

630
00:38:52,750 --> 00:38:53,583
Sorry.

631
00:38:56,291 --> 00:38:58,875
Nisha, you've become so mischievous.

632
00:38:58,958 --> 00:39:00,375
Should we give you two injections?

633
00:39:00,458 --> 00:39:02,416
One in the morning and one at night.

634
00:39:02,500 --> 00:39:04,375
-It will take your pain away.
-No.

635
00:39:05,458 --> 00:39:07,125
-Yes, yes, yes.
-No, no, no.

636
00:39:07,208 --> 00:39:09,416
My good girl.

637
00:39:09,500 --> 00:39:12,333
If I get the poke, even you'll get one.

638
00:39:12,416 --> 00:39:13,666
Oh, really?

639
00:39:13,750 --> 00:39:15,625
But I'm a good girl.

640
00:39:15,708 --> 00:39:18,916
But, Mummy, even you're naughty at times.

641
00:39:19,500 --> 00:39:21,500
-Do you want some more?
-No, no. No.

642
00:39:21,583 --> 00:39:23,750
-You're done?
-I am done.

643
00:39:23,833 --> 00:39:25,708
Okay. Now lie down.

644
00:39:27,458 --> 00:39:29,458
The other day, you could barely move.

645
00:39:29,541 --> 00:39:31,375
"My tummy's hurting. My tummy's hurting."

646
00:39:31,458 --> 00:39:33,125
My tummy was hurting.

647
00:39:33,208 --> 00:39:35,375
Your tummy was hurting, not mine.

648
00:39:35,458 --> 00:39:37,750
Not mine, your tummy.

649
00:39:37,833 --> 00:39:40,250
-Nisha, how are you feeling today?
-Mummy.

650
00:39:40,333 --> 00:39:41,208
I am good.

651
00:39:41,291 --> 00:39:43,750
Much better. Come on, let's see.
Take a deep breath.

652
00:39:44,833 --> 00:39:46,208
Hey, get me a cup of tea.

653
00:39:46,291 --> 00:39:47,291
Yes, sir!

654
00:39:48,583 --> 00:39:49,708
One cup of tea, please.

655
00:39:53,666 --> 00:39:54,666
Saha.

656
00:39:55,625 --> 00:39:58,500
During the festival,
the export of idols, lamps,

657
00:39:58,583 --> 00:40:01,375
handicrafts, everything will be halted.

658
00:40:01,458 --> 00:40:04,708
This is the season for local businesses
to earn extra money.

659
00:40:05,375 --> 00:40:08,333
Actually the Bahurupi people
are natives of the city.

660
00:40:08,416 --> 00:40:10,416
We all have come here from other places.

661
00:40:11,625 --> 00:40:13,916
Since ancient times,
there's been a practice here.

662
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:17,875
The practice of sacrificing the girls
to please the Goddess.

663
00:40:18,541 --> 00:40:21,666
This is land of the Bahurupis.
Don't mess with them.

664
00:40:23,208 --> 00:40:26,291
All roads leading out of Joypurra
will remain shut.

665
00:40:27,166 --> 00:40:28,333
Revoke the clearance.

666
00:40:28,416 --> 00:40:29,416
Now.

667
00:40:32,750 --> 00:40:34,416
<i>Dada Bhai, the new officer has shut down</i>

668
00:40:34,500 --> 00:40:36,083
<i>the trade routes with immediate effect.</i>

669
00:40:36,166 --> 00:40:38,041
So will the consignment
have to be taken out

670
00:40:38,125 --> 00:40:39,500
from another city now?

671
00:40:40,500 --> 00:40:45,166
The consignments will definitely leave
only from the city of Joypurra.

672
00:40:45,250 --> 00:40:49,250
Because Joypurra
is astrologically suited.

673
00:40:50,250 --> 00:40:53,083
When the stars align favourably…

674
00:40:55,458 --> 00:40:57,791
and the netherworlds calls,

675
00:40:59,833 --> 00:41:03,958
at that time,
the girls will leave Joypurra.

676
00:41:04,041 --> 00:41:09,916
They'll disappear even as the officers
will be keeping a watch on us.

677
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:11,833
Using Plan Zero.

678
00:41:15,083 --> 00:41:17,750
-Papa! Papa! Papa!
-Mishty!

679
00:41:17,833 --> 00:41:19,458
Papa! Papa!

680
00:41:19,541 --> 00:41:21,125
-Mishty!
-Papa!

681
00:41:21,208 --> 00:41:22,875
Mishty! Mishty!

682
00:41:39,166 --> 00:41:41,041
<i>Topical medication</i>

683
00:41:41,125 --> 00:41:43,041
won't work internally.

684
00:41:43,125 --> 00:41:44,750
Special herbs are required

685
00:41:44,833 --> 00:41:46,666
for a complete cure.

686
00:41:46,750 --> 00:41:50,375
There are two sides to Joypurra.

687
00:41:50,458 --> 00:41:52,750
One that you can see with the naked eye.

688
00:41:57,958 --> 00:41:59,000
<i>And the other…</i>

689
00:41:59,750 --> 00:42:01,375
a dark one beneath

690
00:42:01,458 --> 00:42:02,375
that's hidden away.

691
00:42:04,000 --> 00:42:05,416
Lift your foot for a moment.

692
00:42:13,916 --> 00:42:17,458
<i>These tunnels have a long history.</i>

693
00:42:18,041 --> 00:42:21,083
{\an8}<i>The rebellion against the British Raj,</i>

694
00:42:21,875 --> 00:42:23,375
<i>the greed of drug cartels.</i>

695
00:42:24,333 --> 00:42:25,208
And now…

696
00:42:28,416 --> 00:42:33,083
<i>The visible Joypurra can be handled</i>
<i>by the police by barricading it.</i>

697
00:42:33,166 --> 00:42:35,416
<i>But the Joypurra beneath…</i>

698
00:42:35,500 --> 00:42:37,500
<i>…the invisible one,</i>

699
00:42:37,583 --> 00:42:40,000
how does one deal with that?

700
00:42:41,875 --> 00:42:44,166
But the JSF has shut the tunnels
and sealed all of them.

701
00:42:44,250 --> 00:42:48,083
The government register
does not have all the records.

702
00:42:48,166 --> 00:42:49,708
And who knows,

703
00:42:49,791 --> 00:42:52,791
maybe a tunnel somewhere
has been left open.

704
00:42:57,000 --> 00:42:58,875
<i>Where can I find these open tunnels?</i>

705
00:43:02,125 --> 00:43:04,041
Looks like an old map of the city.

706
00:43:05,375 --> 00:43:08,416
{\an8}This old map will lead you
to those tunnels.

707
00:43:12,416 --> 00:43:13,583
<i>But…</i>

708
00:43:13,666 --> 00:43:16,791
{\an8}you'll have to locate them yourself.

709
00:43:25,333 --> 00:43:26,166
Hello?

710
00:43:27,583 --> 00:43:30,083
Can I get a relaxing head massage
with hot oil, please?

711
00:43:33,333 --> 00:43:35,833
Yes, sure, sir.

712
00:43:35,916 --> 00:43:38,250
-I'll go heat up the oil and come.
-Yeah, sure.

713
00:43:39,833 --> 00:43:44,041
{\an8}The word is out that something big

714
00:43:44,541 --> 00:43:46,791
{\an8}is going to happen in Joypurra

715
00:43:46,875 --> 00:43:50,333
<i>through these dark and dangerous tunnels.</i>

716
00:44:21,166 --> 00:44:24,083
And if Goddess Chaumukhi wishes,

717
00:44:25,000 --> 00:44:26,500
she'll help you,

718
00:44:26,583 --> 00:44:28,083
and you'll find your daughter.

719
00:44:46,541 --> 00:44:48,916
Saha mentioned
something about the Bahurupis.

720
00:44:49,000 --> 00:44:52,708
This tribe walks around freely
in disguise.

721
00:44:52,791 --> 00:44:54,708
They watch and observe everything.

722
00:44:54,791 --> 00:44:56,375
But they go unnoticed.

723
00:45:00,708 --> 00:45:03,291
We should blend in with them
to get some leads.

724
00:45:03,375 --> 00:45:05,208
Sanjukta, be on it.

725
00:45:12,083 --> 00:45:15,458
Reports of dead bodies
are not being filed at the police station.

726
00:45:15,541 --> 00:45:17,291
Sir, please, we need your help.

727
00:45:17,375 --> 00:45:19,250
Oh, hell! You're back again?

728
00:45:19,333 --> 00:45:20,916
We can't find your child's body.

729
00:45:21,000 --> 00:45:22,916
I'd rather be looking
for a child who's alive

730
00:45:23,000 --> 00:45:24,666
than be looking
your child's body, isn't it?

731
00:45:24,750 --> 00:45:27,208
I can't understand
where these girls have just disappeared.

732
00:45:27,291 --> 00:45:28,541
And at the same time,

733
00:45:28,625 --> 00:45:31,416
the girls are being taken to a place
called Lal Bari.

734
00:45:33,000 --> 00:45:34,666
Spicy puffed rice!

735
00:45:36,083 --> 00:45:37,666
Spicy puffed rice!

736
00:45:39,041 --> 00:45:41,500
Can't tell
whether they are dead or alive.

737
00:45:41,583 --> 00:45:43,750
<i>And strangely,</i>
<i>everyone in this area is curious</i>

738
00:45:43,833 --> 00:45:45,416
<i>to know what goes on there.</i>

739
00:45:46,708 --> 00:45:49,666
<i>Only you can go inside</i>
<i>and find out, Liliya.</i>

740
00:45:49,750 --> 00:45:51,541
Spicy puffed rice!

741
00:46:00,875 --> 00:46:01,791
Yes?

742
00:46:01,875 --> 00:46:03,250
Uh, is Sarita at home?

743
00:46:03,791 --> 00:46:04,958
Who?

744
00:46:05,041 --> 00:46:06,583
You've got the wrong house.

745
00:46:07,958 --> 00:46:09,625
Can you… Oh, God.

746
00:46:13,500 --> 00:46:14,583
Lane number three.

747
00:46:14,666 --> 00:46:15,791
Uh, that way?

748
00:46:15,875 --> 00:46:16,708
Yes.

749
00:46:16,791 --> 00:46:18,125
Okay.

750
00:46:34,500 --> 00:46:35,416
Sorry, sorry.

751
00:46:35,500 --> 00:46:37,375
I'm… I'm looking
for lane number three.

752
00:46:37,458 --> 00:46:38,416
Can you…

753
00:46:47,791 --> 00:46:50,916
<i>Tiny little swallow Cute little swallow</i>

754
00:46:51,000 --> 00:46:54,291
<i>Lost in the woods, this little swallow</i>

755
00:46:54,375 --> 00:46:57,416
<i>Tiny little swallow</i>
<i>Cute little swallow</i>

756
00:46:57,500 --> 00:46:59,958
<i>Lost in this woods</i>
<i>This little swallow</i>

757
00:47:02,458 --> 00:47:03,541
Are you sure?

758
00:47:03,625 --> 00:47:06,458
Yes, we have spoken to them,
but how did it happen so suddenly?

759
00:47:06,541 --> 00:47:07,875
Hmm, Bani.

760
00:47:07,958 --> 00:47:09,833
The hospital just called to say

761
00:47:09,916 --> 00:47:12,958
that Nisha's condition
had suddenly deteriorated.

762
00:47:13,625 --> 00:47:14,916
We've lost her.

763
00:47:25,666 --> 00:47:26,708
Uh, Nisha Mitra.

764
00:47:26,791 --> 00:47:29,708
Sorry, ma'am. Her parents are doing
the paperwork to take the body.

765
00:47:29,791 --> 00:47:31,458
I can't let you go in.
It's not allowed.

766
00:47:31,541 --> 00:47:34,541
Listen, please. Uh, I'm her teacher.
I just need two minutes.

767
00:47:34,625 --> 00:47:36,541
I need to sprinkle some holy water on her.

768
00:47:36,625 --> 00:47:39,083
That's all.
I'll leave immediately after that.

769
00:47:39,166 --> 00:47:40,916
Uh, I'll take her inside.

770
00:47:41,000 --> 00:47:42,958
Bani ma'am,
come with me. I'll show you the way.

771
00:47:43,041 --> 00:47:44,958
Okay, thank you. Yeah.

772
00:47:45,041 --> 00:47:47,708
I was just telling her
that I'll be back soon.

773
00:47:47,791 --> 00:47:49,875
I… I'll be back in two minutes.
It won't take very long.

774
00:47:49,958 --> 00:47:52,416
Be careful. To the left. This way.

775
00:47:53,375 --> 00:47:54,666
Nisha Mitra's body.

776
00:48:01,000 --> 00:48:01,833
Come here.

777
00:48:02,416 --> 00:48:04,166
Wait. Right here. Here.

778
00:48:30,833 --> 00:48:31,958
-Bani ma'am.
-Hmm?

779
00:48:32,041 --> 00:48:33,125
-Nisha.
-Huh.

780
00:48:40,500 --> 00:48:41,333
Bani ma'am…

781
00:48:41,958 --> 00:48:43,291
Please don't touch the body.

782
00:48:43,375 --> 00:48:45,041
Sprinkle it on the side here.

783
00:48:58,125 --> 00:48:59,166
I can't breathe.

784
00:48:59,916 --> 00:49:00,958
I can't breathe.

785
00:49:01,791 --> 00:49:04,125
-May I have some water?
-Yeah, yeah, sure.

786
00:49:04,208 --> 00:49:06,625
Relax, Bani ma'am. Sit down. Sit here.

787
00:49:07,333 --> 00:49:09,041
You're just stressed out.

788
00:49:09,125 --> 00:49:09,958
Please sit here.

789
00:49:10,041 --> 00:49:12,291
I'll get you some tea and cookies. Okay?

790
00:49:38,541 --> 00:49:39,791
Hello, Jhunu Amba?

791
00:49:39,875 --> 00:49:43,250
Nisha's condition didn't deteriorate.
She's been kidnapped.

792
00:49:43,333 --> 00:49:46,541
They've declared her dead
by passing somebody else's body as hers.

793
00:49:46,625 --> 00:49:49,250
Explains why children's bodies
are being picked up

794
00:49:49,333 --> 00:49:52,458
from Para Nagar, Madhupalli,
and areas around Bhadrapur.

795
00:49:53,291 --> 00:49:56,458
And the police here are not
registering complaints about the bodies.

796
00:49:56,541 --> 00:50:00,166
I'm quite sure that Nisha's right here.

797
00:50:00,250 --> 00:50:01,291
In Joypurra Hospital.

798
00:50:02,000 --> 00:50:03,500
<i>Something's going on here.</i>

799
00:50:03,583 --> 00:50:05,791
<i>We might get to know</i>
<i>something about Mishty.</i>

800
00:50:05,875 --> 00:50:07,583
Please come back, Jhunu Amba.

801
00:50:24,333 --> 00:50:26,166
Everything is completed.
The van has arrived.

802
00:50:26,250 --> 00:50:27,583
-Take her down carefully.
-Yeah, yeah.

803
00:50:30,333 --> 00:50:33,250
Sukhit Sarkar, step aside.
Please come inside.

804
00:51:22,458 --> 00:51:23,916
Uh, um…

805
00:51:24,000 --> 00:51:26,416
Where's the pharmacy here?

806
00:51:27,500 --> 00:51:28,875
Is anyone around?

807
00:51:41,541 --> 00:51:43,083
-Anyone around?
-Yes.

808
00:51:43,791 --> 00:51:46,125
-Where's the pharmacy here?
-That way.

809
00:51:47,208 --> 00:51:48,083
That way?

810
00:51:48,166 --> 00:51:49,666
That way, there.

811
00:52:48,333 --> 00:52:50,333
<i>Attention, all staff!</i>

812
00:52:50,416 --> 00:52:52,166
<i>This is code 256.</i>

813
00:53:03,708 --> 00:53:06,875
<i>-The hospital sewer pipeline has burst.</i>
-Please wait for some time.

814
00:53:06,958 --> 00:53:09,916
<i>Caution is advised</i>
<i>to everyone in the hospital.</i>

815
00:53:10,000 --> 00:53:12,041
<i>This is code 256.</i>

816
00:54:57,416 --> 00:54:58,500
Oh, my God. He's injured.

817
00:54:58,583 --> 00:55:00,958
-You go there and check.
-You both go there and search.

818
00:55:01,041 --> 00:55:02,500
Who's over there? Even he's injured!

819
00:55:02,583 --> 00:55:03,416
Where?

820
00:55:03,500 --> 00:55:04,916
-Can someone help me?
-Boss will get angry.

821
00:55:05,000 --> 00:55:06,166
How did he get in here?

822
00:55:07,000 --> 00:55:09,125
Four bags of clothes
and three with children.

823
00:55:09,208 --> 00:55:11,375
Yeah, yeah, understood. You know code 256?

824
00:55:11,458 --> 00:55:13,875
Hurry up.
We need to make the delivery on time.

825
00:55:13,958 --> 00:55:15,125
Pick it up quickly.

826
00:55:19,083 --> 00:55:21,500
Everything's a mess.
Hurry up and leave now.

827
00:55:23,916 --> 00:55:24,750
Hey.

828
00:55:24,833 --> 00:55:25,958
Where is the other bag gone?

829
00:55:26,041 --> 00:55:27,583
Oh, hello. Go now.

830
00:55:27,666 --> 00:55:28,666
It was right here.

831
00:55:28,750 --> 00:55:29,875
Hurry up and leave now, come on.

832
00:56:42,541 --> 00:56:43,750
Come on, hurry up.

833
00:56:45,958 --> 00:56:47,375
The hospital has complained.

834
00:56:49,458 --> 00:56:51,458
That the girl we abducted from the school,

835
00:56:51,541 --> 00:56:53,458
Nisha, wasn't measured correctly.

836
00:56:53,541 --> 00:56:55,958
She is six inches shorter than the corpse
we swapped her with.

837
00:56:56,041 --> 00:56:58,875
If the parents figure it out,
Plan Zero is finished.

838
00:57:01,250 --> 00:57:02,750
-It's not my fault.
-Keep it low.

839
00:57:03,375 --> 00:57:05,166
The body was marked at Laal Badi.

840
00:57:05,791 --> 00:57:07,083
You should ask Mukesh.

841
00:57:12,958 --> 00:57:13,791
Four feet.

842
00:57:14,791 --> 00:57:17,375
<i>He said four feet, accordingly,</i>
<i>we found a girl in that school,</i>

843
00:57:17,458 --> 00:57:18,375
<i>and gave her candy.</i>

844
00:57:18,458 --> 00:57:21,041
Bani ma'am,
I think she has got food poisoning.

845
00:57:21,125 --> 00:57:24,208
<i>It's possible that the hospital</i>
<i>didn't do a proper job. Perhaps the name--</i>

846
00:57:24,291 --> 00:57:26,291
<i>According to our boss,</i>
<i>everything was done correctly.</i>

847
00:57:26,375 --> 00:57:29,083
{\an8}<i>We have injected the body</i>
<i>of the four-feet girl with the chemical.</i>

848
00:57:29,166 --> 00:57:31,583
<i>Once it's fully absorbed,</i>
<i>no one will recognize her.</i>

849
00:57:33,041 --> 00:57:34,000
Now, go.

850
00:57:34,083 --> 00:57:36,291
Drive around the block and be back.
She'll be ready by then.

851
00:57:36,375 --> 00:57:39,083
I mean the boss really has a devious mind.

852
00:57:41,833 --> 00:57:43,208
With this new officer watching us,

853
00:57:43,291 --> 00:57:45,916
we won't be to take a single girl
out of Joypurra.

854
00:57:49,541 --> 00:57:52,000
Who said the girls were leaving?

855
00:59:01,208 --> 00:59:02,583
Come on, leave.

856
00:59:36,416 --> 00:59:37,916
Gobind, hurry up.

857
00:59:38,000 --> 00:59:39,958
Uma ma'am wants everything done
as soon as possible.

858
00:59:40,041 --> 00:59:41,125
Hmm, all right.

859
01:00:04,500 --> 01:00:07,458
{\an8}Sir, the festival
of the Goddess has begun today.

860
01:00:07,541 --> 01:00:09,333
{\an8}And security has been increased
considerably.

861
01:00:09,416 --> 01:00:13,375
{\an8}Main Chowk, Toll Naka,
Joypurra Docks, and also on the beach.

862
01:00:14,750 --> 01:00:16,583
{\an8}You need to be extremely alert.

863
01:00:16,666 --> 01:00:20,250
And also, talk to your sources
on the ground.

864
01:00:20,333 --> 01:00:21,291
Yes, sir.

865
01:00:40,041 --> 01:00:40,916
Somu, come in.

866
01:01:29,958 --> 01:01:31,000
Churni ma'am. Churni ma'am.

867
01:01:31,083 --> 01:01:32,291
Churni ma'am.

868
01:01:32,375 --> 01:01:34,375
-Bani?
-Ma'am, I…

869
01:01:34,458 --> 01:01:35,666
What are you doing here?

870
01:01:35,750 --> 01:01:37,791
-Are you all right?
-Churni ma'am!

871
01:01:37,875 --> 01:01:40,291
Arrangements for tonight's immersion
are going very well.

872
01:01:40,375 --> 01:01:42,791
And, yes, I have kept
your laundry bag inside.

873
01:01:42,875 --> 01:01:44,291
Good morning, Bani ma'am.

874
01:01:44,375 --> 01:01:45,583
Are you okay?

875
01:01:46,333 --> 01:01:47,708
Take care.

876
01:01:47,791 --> 01:01:49,041
Love you, too.

877
01:01:49,125 --> 01:01:51,166
What's the matter? Tell me.

878
01:01:51,250 --> 01:01:53,541
I'll come later.

879
01:01:53,625 --> 01:01:55,583
-Huh?
-Ma'am, I'll come later.

880
01:01:57,583 --> 01:01:59,083
Is everything okay, Bani?

881
01:02:04,958 --> 01:02:07,708
<i>I thought I was looking</i>
<i>for the demon of Joypurra.</i>

882
01:02:11,541 --> 01:02:13,291
<i>But what I didn't know</i>

883
01:02:13,375 --> 01:02:15,916
<i>is that Joypurra had demons everywhere.</i>

884
01:02:19,375 --> 01:02:21,833
<i>In fact, Joypurra itself is the demon.</i>

885
01:02:33,416 --> 01:02:35,875
<i>This old map will lead you</i>
<i>to those tunnels.</i>

886
01:02:35,958 --> 01:02:37,125
<i>And who knows,</i>

887
01:02:37,208 --> 01:02:40,208
maybe a tunnel somewhere
has been left open.

888
01:02:53,083 --> 01:02:54,041
Come on, run.

889
01:02:55,875 --> 01:02:56,833
Bani.

890
01:03:00,041 --> 01:03:02,916
Where did you go earlier?
What's the matter with you today?

891
01:03:03,000 --> 01:03:06,833
I wasn't feeling too well,
so I came back to meet the girls.

892
01:03:06,916 --> 01:03:09,000
That's nice.

893
01:03:09,083 --> 01:03:11,083
Hmm. Come here. Sit down.

894
01:03:11,791 --> 01:03:13,291
I'll get you a cup of tea.

895
01:03:15,583 --> 01:03:18,541
<i>Tiny little swallow</i>
<i>Cute little swallow</i>

896
01:03:18,625 --> 01:03:21,333
<i>Lost in the woods</i>
<i>This little swallow </i>

897
01:03:21,416 --> 01:03:26,250
<i>Flying, flying far away</i>
<i>She lost her way </i>

898
01:03:26,333 --> 01:03:28,041
<i>And went astray</i>

899
01:03:28,125 --> 01:03:30,416
<i>On a branch, all alone</i>

900
01:03:30,500 --> 01:03:32,708
<i>No friend to call her own</i>

901
01:03:32,791 --> 01:03:36,250
<i>Then another came laughing by</i>

902
01:03:36,333 --> 01:03:37,708
Mishty! Mi…

903
01:03:53,041 --> 01:03:55,458
I really love this poem.
It's my favourite.

904
01:03:55,541 --> 01:03:56,708
Who taught you this?

905
01:03:56,791 --> 01:03:57,916
A friend.

906
01:04:04,583 --> 01:04:08,333
So, tell me.
Did any new friends come here today?

907
01:04:08,416 --> 01:04:09,250
Huh?

908
01:04:09,333 --> 01:04:11,958
No, aunty. No new friends came today.

909
01:04:12,041 --> 01:04:14,083
But a few days ago,

910
01:04:14,166 --> 01:04:15,791
when we went to the beach,

911
01:04:15,875 --> 01:04:17,625
Dakkhinpara Beach,

912
01:04:17,708 --> 01:04:21,208
my friend Pinky
didn't come back with us from there.

913
01:04:24,375 --> 01:04:30,750
The water demon and the fish-eating ghost,
they scared her and took her into the sea.

914
01:04:42,125 --> 01:04:47,208
Churni ma'am also told us that
we should not play with our new friends.

915
01:04:47,291 --> 01:04:49,916
She said they need to rest.

916
01:04:51,916 --> 01:04:54,333
Hey, you're not allowed to go in there!

917
01:04:57,708 --> 01:04:59,208
Wanna play hide and seek?

918
01:04:59,291 --> 01:05:00,291
-Huh?
-Yes.

919
01:05:00,375 --> 01:05:03,916
You count to 20, all right?
And I'll go hide somewhere. Come on.

920
01:05:04,666 --> 01:05:06,000
This way. Start.

921
01:05:07,000 --> 01:05:08,041
One.

922
01:05:10,583 --> 01:05:11,958
Two.

923
01:05:13,541 --> 01:05:15,583
Three.

924
01:05:17,541 --> 01:05:18,791
Four.

925
01:05:22,125 --> 01:05:23,208
<i>Hello, Mr. Gokul?</i>

926
01:05:23,291 --> 01:05:26,208
<i>I'm calling from the school.</i>
<i>Has Bani reached home?</i>

927
01:05:26,291 --> 01:05:28,708
Bani… Not yet. Why?

928
01:05:28,791 --> 01:05:30,666
<i>She went to see Nisha at the hospital.</i>

929
01:05:30,750 --> 01:05:33,000
<i>She hasn't come back to school,</i>
<i>and she's not answering her phone.</i>

930
01:05:33,083 --> 01:05:34,166
Uh, where could she go?

931
01:06:11,875 --> 01:06:12,708
Bani!

932
01:06:13,458 --> 01:06:14,916
Tea!

933
01:06:15,000 --> 01:06:16,500
Eighteen.

934
01:06:19,250 --> 01:06:20,791
Nineteen.

935
01:06:23,375 --> 01:06:24,916
Got you!

936
01:06:28,208 --> 01:06:30,458
-Let's go. Come on.
-Bani.

937
01:06:31,541 --> 01:06:32,458
Churni ma'am.

938
01:06:33,333 --> 01:06:35,041
We were playing hide and seek.

939
01:06:35,791 --> 01:06:37,250
I'm feeling a lot better now.

940
01:06:37,916 --> 01:06:39,791
Maybe, I should go home now.

941
01:06:40,500 --> 01:06:41,333
Tea?

942
01:06:43,500 --> 01:06:47,458
Well, I'll come… I'll come by tomorrow.
I'll leave now.

943
01:06:49,416 --> 01:06:50,500
All right.

944
01:07:11,500 --> 01:07:13,083
I did find the laundry bags,

945
01:07:14,375 --> 01:07:15,750
but the girls weren't in them.

946
01:07:15,833 --> 01:07:18,083
You sure you saw them being taken inside?

947
01:07:18,833 --> 01:07:21,041
I saw Somesh taking them inside.

948
01:07:21,125 --> 01:07:23,333
There has to be a secret way.

949
01:07:29,750 --> 01:07:31,541
Go. She's standing at the gate.

950
01:07:31,625 --> 01:07:33,208
I'll go and check in on Uma.

951
01:07:35,791 --> 01:07:37,416
-Call me.
-Yes.

952
01:07:47,541 --> 01:07:49,583
You asked me to come
to Shishukal immediately.

953
01:07:49,666 --> 01:07:50,875
Is there any information?

954
01:07:50,958 --> 01:07:52,833
We'll talk later.

955
01:08:20,666 --> 01:08:21,708
Bahurupi?

956
01:08:21,791 --> 01:08:23,416
Mm-hmm.

957
01:08:23,500 --> 01:08:25,791
Nice. Would you like to perform
for the children?

958
01:08:25,875 --> 01:08:27,291
Uh, ugh…

959
01:08:27,958 --> 01:08:29,666
-Shall we?
-Hmm.

960
01:08:29,750 --> 01:08:31,666
We need to get the girls out today.

961
01:08:34,291 --> 01:08:37,250
After that, you disappear for a few days.

962
01:08:37,333 --> 01:08:38,458
All right.

963
01:08:42,958 --> 01:08:45,458
-The boss will let you know.
-Okay.

964
01:08:48,250 --> 01:08:50,416
-When and where to meet.
-Do you have masks?

965
01:08:50,500 --> 01:08:51,791
Tiger, bear, or monkey?

966
01:08:51,875 --> 01:08:52,875
-Monkey.
-Monkey.

967
01:09:05,916 --> 01:09:06,916
Want to try it on?

968
01:09:11,083 --> 01:09:12,375
Looks really nice.

969
01:09:13,375 --> 01:09:14,541
Okay.

970
01:09:15,791 --> 01:09:17,000
Oh, Bani!

971
01:09:18,000 --> 01:09:19,500
-Oh.
-Hey, Uma.

972
01:09:19,583 --> 01:09:20,541
Yes.

973
01:09:26,166 --> 01:09:27,291
-Oh, Bani.
-Yes?

974
01:09:27,375 --> 01:09:29,208
I'll see you in the evening,
we'll have tea together.

975
01:09:29,291 --> 01:09:30,208
-Yeah.
-All right?

976
01:09:30,291 --> 01:09:31,291
Yeah.

977
01:09:33,083 --> 01:09:35,291
Bani ma'am, how are you?

978
01:10:16,208 --> 01:10:17,083
Saurabh!

979
01:10:21,791 --> 01:10:23,000
Is everything all right?

980
01:10:23,083 --> 01:10:24,708
-Yes, it is.
-Hmm.

981
01:10:59,416 --> 01:11:00,416
Go and check there.

982
01:11:16,833 --> 01:11:18,083
Amba, listen.

983
01:11:18,166 --> 01:11:21,000
I'm at the Biswas Wire Factory.
Please come here soon.

984
01:12:29,208 --> 01:12:31,625
Liliya, Liliya, let's go.

985
01:12:59,833 --> 01:13:01,791
Bani, you're really blind.

986
01:13:01,875 --> 01:13:04,416
Churni already told me you can see.

987
01:13:05,458 --> 01:13:07,541
So I made some inquiries.

988
01:13:07,625 --> 01:13:09,833
And I got to know a lot about you.

989
01:13:09,916 --> 01:13:12,416
Things that even you don't know
about yourself.

990
01:13:12,500 --> 01:13:14,666
And your dear Jhunu Amba.

991
01:13:14,750 --> 01:13:16,041
A mother to you.

992
01:13:16,125 --> 01:13:18,375
In reality, a witch.

993
01:13:18,458 --> 01:13:22,416
Years ago, your dearest Jhunu
trusted her brother

994
01:13:22,500 --> 01:13:26,708
and sent you all with him
to perform acrobatics on the streets.

995
01:13:28,333 --> 01:13:34,166
And her dear brother later sold
you four girls to us for some money.

996
01:13:34,875 --> 01:13:36,708
And, Bani, you were one of them.

997
01:13:42,166 --> 01:13:43,500
Let me go!

998
01:14:19,416 --> 01:14:22,208
-Run! Run!
-Get up. Get up.

999
01:14:22,291 --> 01:14:23,916
Get down. Keep quiet, you.

1000
01:14:24,000 --> 01:14:25,333
-Come!
-Run!

1001
01:14:25,416 --> 01:14:26,916
Come, lady. Quick… Quickly.

1002
01:14:27,000 --> 01:14:28,250
Run!

1003
01:14:28,333 --> 01:14:29,375
Come on!

1004
01:14:31,083 --> 01:14:33,375
No! No!

1005
01:14:33,458 --> 01:14:34,958
Leave us.

1006
01:14:37,166 --> 01:14:38,791
Hey, what the heck!

1007
01:14:40,250 --> 01:14:41,625
He's driving our van! Come on!

1008
01:14:41,708 --> 01:14:43,333
Come on, come on! Quick!

1009
01:14:45,750 --> 01:14:48,916
<i>That's where you met your husband Gokul.</i>

1010
01:14:49,000 --> 01:14:51,208
You were lucky he saved you.

1011
01:14:51,958 --> 01:14:53,208
But we have a rule.

1012
01:14:54,291 --> 01:14:56,291
A girl for a girl.

1013
01:14:56,375 --> 01:14:58,916
Jhunu Amba's granddaughter,

1014
01:14:59,000 --> 01:15:01,958
Dulari, paid the price
for those four girls

1015
01:15:02,041 --> 01:15:03,791
and was picked up in the bargain.

1016
01:15:05,750 --> 01:15:06,750
But this

1017
01:15:06,833 --> 01:15:10,250
Jhunu Amba wouldn't give up.

1018
01:15:10,333 --> 01:15:12,416
In exchange for her granddaughter,

1019
01:15:12,500 --> 01:15:14,416
this woman traded your daughter.

1020
01:15:15,083 --> 01:15:16,958
Last year, in Chaksuliyapada,

1021
01:15:17,041 --> 01:15:20,500
your dearest Jhunu Amba made a deal
and gave us your address.

1022
01:15:20,583 --> 01:15:24,833
How would we know where you,
your husband and your daughter were?

1023
01:15:24,916 --> 01:15:26,541
We picked her up.

1024
01:15:26,625 --> 01:15:27,958
Yeah.

1025
01:15:28,750 --> 01:15:29,791
Hey!

1026
01:15:30,708 --> 01:15:32,666
Did you give the address?

1027
01:15:32,750 --> 01:15:34,541
Did you tell them?

1028
01:15:38,583 --> 01:15:40,250
I only gave Gokul's address.

1029
01:15:40,916 --> 01:15:43,583
I made a deal for Gokul
in exchange for Dulari.

1030
01:15:43,666 --> 01:15:45,916
I didn't know
they would take Mishty instead.

1031
01:15:48,875 --> 01:15:52,166
When Mishty was taken,
all I did was look for her day and night.

1032
01:15:52,250 --> 01:15:54,500
I was helpless.
Please understand, Liliya.

1033
01:15:54,583 --> 01:15:57,333
-I'm a mother too.
-Hey!

1034
01:15:58,291 --> 01:16:00,375
Don't you call yourself a mother.

1035
01:16:00,458 --> 01:16:02,375
You're nothing but a wretched woman.

1036
01:16:28,083 --> 01:16:30,416
<i>Life is chain of events.</i>

1037
01:16:34,875 --> 01:16:40,250
<i>The past, the present, and the future,</i>

1038
01:16:40,333 --> 01:16:42,250
<i>it's all connected.</i>

1039
01:16:47,375 --> 01:16:50,291
<i>My Liliya is not done yet.</i>

1040
01:16:52,875 --> 01:16:53,708
Bani!

1041
01:16:57,500 --> 01:16:58,791
What happened?

1042
01:17:01,916 --> 01:17:03,416
-Are you okay?
-Let's go from here.

1043
01:17:05,750 --> 01:17:06,833
Let's leave.

1044
01:17:09,916 --> 01:17:11,250
Straight and right.

1045
01:17:15,708 --> 01:17:17,458
<i>I am the one who can't see.</i>

1046
01:17:19,750 --> 01:17:21,625
<i>Clearly didn't realize you could.</i>

1047
01:17:24,458 --> 01:17:26,958
A father can die
a million deaths for his child.

1048
01:17:28,541 --> 01:17:30,750
And I couldn't even protect my daughter.

1049
01:17:32,125 --> 01:17:33,583
I couldn't save her.

1050
01:17:35,583 --> 01:17:37,791
You must have thought,
what's the point of telling me all this?

1051
01:17:37,875 --> 01:17:41,208
Gokul, I didn't tell you because it'd mean
putting your life at risk.

1052
01:17:41,291 --> 01:17:43,416
-They would have come and hurt--
-What did you think?

1053
01:17:43,500 --> 01:17:46,458
That I just sit at the toll booth
just to issue tickets all day?

1054
01:17:46,541 --> 01:17:47,500
<i>Huh?</i>

1055
01:17:47,583 --> 01:17:50,208
<i>Day and night, I was only thinking of ways</i>
<i>to get Mishty back.</i>

1056
01:17:51,125 --> 01:17:53,125
<i>I was trying to find out</i>
<i>everything about the Blackhole.</i>

1057
01:18:06,416 --> 01:18:09,416
We are the ones disguising ourselves
just like the Bahurupi folk.

1058
01:18:11,250 --> 01:18:14,833
I thought I'll… I'll disguise myself
as a blind woman

1059
01:18:14,916 --> 01:18:16,708
to find out about the Blackhole gang.

1060
01:18:18,000 --> 01:18:20,416
And I managed to do so as well.

1061
01:18:20,500 --> 01:18:24,166
Uma, Churni, Gobind,
they're all in this together.

1062
01:18:24,250 --> 01:18:26,833
And Somesh, I saw him a few hours ago.

1063
01:18:26,916 --> 01:18:29,208
He changed the girls' names,
disguised them

1064
01:18:29,291 --> 01:18:31,583
and took them to Shishukal,
the children's home.

1065
01:18:33,333 --> 01:18:35,125
I just don't understand
how they're taking the girls

1066
01:18:35,208 --> 01:18:37,291
out of the city from inside the orphanage.

1067
01:18:43,666 --> 01:18:45,208
Through these tunnels.

1068
01:18:45,291 --> 01:18:48,583
Something big will happen tonight
during Goddess Chaumukhi's veneration.

1069
01:18:48,666 --> 01:18:49,958
I have to inform the senior officer.

1070
01:18:56,291 --> 01:18:58,000
And please don't go anywhere
until I'm back, okay?

1071
01:18:58,083 --> 01:18:59,375
I'll leave now.

1072
01:19:00,666 --> 01:19:04,041
Gokul, I'll be waiting for you.
Come back soon.

1073
01:19:13,916 --> 01:19:15,208
I'll be back very soon.

1074
01:19:34,125 --> 01:19:36,375
{\an8}Everyone stay alert in areas
near the port.

1075
01:19:36,458 --> 01:19:39,208
No consignment without my permission
will leave the port, okay?

1076
01:19:39,291 --> 01:19:40,291
-Sure.
-In case of emergency…

1077
01:19:40,375 --> 01:19:41,583
-Kabir sir!
-Stop.

1078
01:19:41,666 --> 01:19:43,541
I need to tell you
something important, sir. Please.

1079
01:19:47,875 --> 01:19:50,416
Sir, as per my research,
there could also be tunnels in the area

1080
01:19:50,500 --> 01:19:52,083
<i>between Shishukal and Dakkhinpara.</i>

1081
01:19:53,625 --> 01:19:56,291
Why weren't these tunnels mentioned
in the list of underground tunnels?

1082
01:19:56,375 --> 01:19:59,625
<i>Sir, this report</i>
<i>only mentions the sealed tunnels</i>

1083
01:20:00,291 --> 01:20:02,708
that lead out of the city.

1084
01:20:02,791 --> 01:20:06,166
Or the ones that have been marked
in the threat report.

1085
01:20:06,250 --> 01:20:07,750
Hello, officer.

1086
01:20:08,250 --> 01:20:10,416
I have a search warrant for the premises.

1087
01:20:11,541 --> 01:20:13,041
Jaishree, bring the keys.

1088
01:20:13,125 --> 01:20:14,958
You go move all the kids to one side.

1089
01:20:15,041 --> 01:20:16,583
Come on, children.

1090
01:20:18,625 --> 01:20:20,291
Pradeep, open the doors.

1091
01:20:23,083 --> 01:20:24,500
Search all the rooms.

1092
01:20:24,583 --> 01:20:27,500
I want every corner of this place
to be checked thoroughly.

1093
01:20:51,041 --> 01:20:52,208
Sir.

1094
01:20:52,291 --> 01:20:53,291
Sir.

1095
01:20:53,375 --> 01:20:55,291
According to the register,
there should be 30 girls.

1096
01:20:55,375 --> 01:20:57,500
And all 30 girls are here.

1097
01:20:57,583 --> 01:21:00,666
Also, there aren't any hidden doors
or even a secret tunnel.

1098
01:21:10,208 --> 01:21:11,416
I'm on my way.

1099
01:21:13,791 --> 01:21:14,791
-Pradeep.
-Yes, sir.

1100
01:21:14,875 --> 01:21:15,750
Call the unit.

1101
01:21:15,833 --> 01:21:17,125
-Let's go.
-We're leaving.

1102
01:21:17,208 --> 01:21:18,500
<i>Now!</i>

1103
01:21:19,666 --> 01:21:21,291
Yes, Bani?

1104
01:21:21,375 --> 01:21:22,458
<i>Gokul.</i>

1105
01:21:25,416 --> 01:21:27,500
Gokul? Hel--

1106
01:22:04,333 --> 01:22:06,958
<i>Through these tunnels,</i>
<i>something big will happen tonight</i>

1107
01:22:07,041 --> 01:22:08,958
<i>during Goddess Chaumukhi's veneration.</i>

1108
01:22:12,541 --> 01:22:14,875
<i>Hey, you're not allowed to go in there!</i>

1109
01:22:21,250 --> 01:22:23,250
<i>All the main smuggling routes</i>
<i>had been shut down</i>

1110
01:22:23,333 --> 01:22:25,500
<i>during JSF's anti-tunnels operation.</i>

1111
01:22:28,833 --> 01:22:31,166
<i>Churni ma'am,</i>
<i>arrangements for tonight's immersion</i>

1112
01:22:31,250 --> 01:22:32,250
<i>are going very well.</i>

1113
01:22:49,333 --> 01:22:53,166
-Arise, O Mother Chaumukhi!
-Arise!

1114
01:23:49,833 --> 01:23:51,166
Yeah, I've been looking after things--

1115
01:23:51,250 --> 01:23:53,375
-Sir, the senior officer's on the line.
-You go.

1116
01:23:54,666 --> 01:23:55,500
Sir?

1117
01:23:55,583 --> 01:23:57,458
<i>Leave right away with rest.</i>

1118
01:23:57,541 --> 01:23:59,250
-Okay.
-<i>I'll deal with the AHTU.</i>

1119
01:23:59,333 --> 01:24:00,166
Copy.

1120
01:24:02,416 --> 01:24:03,875
Where were you taking the girl?

1121
01:24:03,958 --> 01:24:05,791
Who are you? Tell me who are you?

1122
01:24:05,875 --> 01:24:07,750
-Whose girl is it, huh? Tell me!
-Papa!

1123
01:24:07,833 --> 01:24:10,083
-That's my daughter.
-Papa!

1124
01:24:16,416 --> 01:24:19,583
Awaken, Chaumukhi. Awaken!

1125
01:24:20,750 --> 01:24:23,375
The local police were supposed
to be on duty. Where are they?

1126
01:24:24,541 --> 01:24:27,375
Sir, we were patrolling
the Dakkhinpara port.

1127
01:24:27,458 --> 01:24:29,625
And then,
suddenly we were called here, sir.

1128
01:24:29,708 --> 01:24:30,708
By whom?

1129
01:25:45,250 --> 01:25:48,666
But a few days ago,
when we went to the beach,

1130
01:25:48,750 --> 01:25:50,041
Dakkhinpara Beach,

1131
01:25:50,125 --> 01:25:53,125
<i>Pinky didn't come back with us from there.</i>

1132
01:25:53,791 --> 01:25:56,333
<i>Through these tunnels,</i>
<i>something big will happen tonight</i>

1133
01:25:56,416 --> 01:25:58,583
<i>during Goddess Chaumukhi's veneration.</i>

1134
01:25:58,666 --> 01:26:01,333
<i>There are still some secret routes</i>
<i>in Joypurra.</i>

1135
01:26:01,416 --> 01:26:03,500
<i>Pinky didn't come back with us from there.</i>

1136
01:26:08,416 --> 01:26:12,166
<i>The water demon and the fish-eating ghost,</i>

1137
01:26:12,250 --> 01:26:15,083
<i>they scared her and took her into the sea.</i>

1138
01:26:18,125 --> 01:26:19,916
<i>It's believed that centuries ago,</i>

1139
01:26:20,000 --> 01:26:22,750
<i>there lived a demon here</i>
<i>by the name of Magrasur.</i>

1140
01:26:24,416 --> 01:26:27,083
<i>He kidnapped children</i>
<i>and took them to the netherworld.</i>

1141
01:26:29,583 --> 01:26:32,833
<i>To save them, Chaumukhi</i>
<i>the goddess of this land herself</i>

1142
01:26:32,916 --> 01:26:34,625
<i>descended into the netherworld.</i>

1143
01:28:03,208 --> 01:28:04,250
Officer Kabir.

1144
01:28:05,500 --> 01:28:06,375
It's a request.

1145
01:28:09,250 --> 01:28:10,416
Please go back.

1146
01:28:12,625 --> 01:28:15,208
You made up all those fake stories.

1147
01:28:15,291 --> 01:28:18,291
Because you wanted the Bahurupis
to take the fall for the Blackhole gang.

1148
01:28:19,250 --> 01:28:20,166
Huh?

1149
01:29:27,416 --> 01:29:29,125
Love you, too.

1150
01:29:31,916 --> 01:29:34,083
Hurry up. Only two more kids to take.

1151
01:29:41,333 --> 01:29:43,000
Hold her properly. Go.

1152
01:29:43,083 --> 01:29:44,750
Go, go, go. Fast! Run!

1153
01:30:43,666 --> 01:30:45,375
We found Nisha, Gokul.

1154
01:30:47,458 --> 01:30:49,333
The other girls are here as well.

1155
01:30:52,291 --> 01:30:54,250
Our Mishty must also be here.

1156
01:30:55,958 --> 01:30:57,083
Let's find her.

1157
01:31:00,666 --> 01:31:04,000
Let's call the police.
They will come and take the girls.

1158
01:31:05,125 --> 01:31:06,541
They are safe now.

1159
01:31:06,625 --> 01:31:08,166
Wha… What?

1160
01:31:09,541 --> 01:31:10,500
Huh?

1161
01:31:11,833 --> 01:31:14,000
Bani, the girls will go
where they're supposed to go.

1162
01:31:17,833 --> 01:31:18,958
Why?

1163
01:31:26,958 --> 01:31:27,833
Gokul?

1164
01:31:29,625 --> 01:31:32,083
Before I met you,
I used to work for the Blackhole.

1165
01:31:35,500 --> 01:31:37,333
<i>Girls were being supplied</i>
<i>to the other cities,</i>

1166
01:31:37,416 --> 01:31:40,208
<i>and I used to make fake IDs for them</i>
<i>from my shop.</i>

1167
01:31:41,583 --> 01:31:44,666
<i>Once I had to go to the field</i>
<i>to deliver a fake ID.</i>

1168
01:31:47,750 --> 01:31:49,916
<i>And that's when I realized</i>
<i>what I was a part of.</i>

1169
01:31:57,416 --> 01:31:58,541
<i>When I saw you there…</i>

1170
01:32:01,583 --> 01:32:03,166
<i>my entire world changed.</i>

1171
01:32:10,291 --> 01:32:13,750
<i>After rescuing you from there,</i>
<i>I felt as if I have redeemed myself.</i>

1172
01:32:14,958 --> 01:32:18,750
I thought I had Blackhole behind forever,
but Blackhole never left me.

1173
01:32:18,833 --> 01:32:21,958
Dulari, Jhunu Amba, and our Mishty,

1174
01:32:22,458 --> 01:32:25,708
<i>that monster had devoured all of them.</i>

1175
01:32:26,625 --> 01:32:28,916
<i>I had no clue that they were operating</i>
<i>from Joypurra.</i>

1176
01:32:29,000 --> 01:32:31,041
<i>Nor did I know</i>
<i>how they were taking the girls from there.</i>

1177
01:32:31,125 --> 01:32:32,291
-Yes, Bani?
-Hey.

1178
01:32:32,375 --> 01:32:34,250
Dada Bhai wants to see you.

1179
01:32:34,333 --> 01:32:36,041
<i>They picked me up</i>
<i>from the children's shelter.</i>

1180
01:32:43,291 --> 01:32:44,875
Hello.

1181
01:32:47,250 --> 01:32:49,000
You know it very well

1182
01:32:50,000 --> 01:32:52,375
that Blackhole will never leave you.

1183
01:32:52,458 --> 01:32:57,708
It's a shadow, and there's only one thing
that can release you.

1184
01:32:57,791 --> 01:32:59,166
Death.

1185
01:33:08,666 --> 01:33:10,875
And you know our rules.

1186
01:33:12,291 --> 01:33:14,625
A girl in exchange for a girl.

1187
01:33:16,375 --> 01:33:18,708
You want to save your daughter Mishty?

1188
01:33:19,833 --> 01:33:23,750
Then help us in sending the others girls
out of the city.

1189
01:33:25,250 --> 01:33:31,500
The wheel of time is turning,
turning, turning, turning and turning.

1190
01:33:32,750 --> 01:33:36,166
The other day,
you failed to protect your Mishty.

1191
01:33:37,541 --> 01:33:40,458
But this time, don't fail.

1192
01:33:48,833 --> 01:33:51,333
It's all up to you.

1193
01:34:03,500 --> 01:34:07,083
If I have to save our Mishty,
I'll have to work with them again, Bani.

1194
01:34:07,625 --> 01:34:08,958
It's either these girls,

1195
01:34:10,083 --> 01:34:11,375
or our Mishty.

1196
01:34:19,125 --> 01:34:21,375
I won't let anything happen to Mishty.

1197
01:34:49,125 --> 01:34:50,625
I'm her father, Bani.

1198
01:34:50,708 --> 01:34:53,541
How can I sacrifice my own daughter?

1199
01:34:53,625 --> 01:34:56,250
And how can I sacrifice so many daughters?

1200
01:34:57,583 --> 01:34:58,583
I'm a mother.

1201
01:35:12,666 --> 01:35:14,458
Please think about our Mishty, Bani.

1202
01:35:15,083 --> 01:35:16,416
Think about our daughter.

1203
01:35:16,500 --> 01:35:17,458
Daughter?

1204
01:35:17,541 --> 01:35:21,625
A man who sells daughters
doesn't deserved to be called a father.

1205
01:35:22,416 --> 01:35:25,250
So dare you call Mishty your daughter.

1206
01:35:40,833 --> 01:35:45,625
<i>You didn't even give it a thought</i>

1207
01:35:47,583 --> 01:35:52,125
<i>You didn't even ask me once</i>

1208
01:35:58,000 --> 01:36:03,500
<i>You didn't even take a good look at me</i>

1209
01:36:08,291 --> 01:36:12,541
<i>You left me all alone</i>

1210
01:36:12,625 --> 01:36:16,083
<i>And walked away</i>

1211
01:36:19,666 --> 01:36:25,666
<i>-O, my love</i>
<i>-I can't live without you</i>

1212
01:36:26,291 --> 01:36:29,583
<i>I can't die without you</i>

1213
01:36:29,666 --> 01:36:35,750
<i>-O my love</i>
<i>-Once broken, it can't be put together</i>

1214
01:36:40,250 --> 01:36:44,250
<i>I flourished because of you</i>

1215
01:36:44,333 --> 01:36:49,541
<i>My heart shattered for you</i>

1216
01:36:49,625 --> 01:36:56,375
<i>-O my love</i>
<i>-Once broken, it can't be put together</i>

1217
01:37:35,250 --> 01:37:41,083
<i>You didn't even give it a thought</i>

1218
01:37:42,791 --> 01:37:44,166
Mishty…

1219
01:37:44,250 --> 01:37:47,541
-Gokul. Gokul. Gokul!
-Mishty…

1220
01:37:50,125 --> 01:37:51,958
-Gokul?
-Mishty…

1221
01:38:38,333 --> 01:38:42,458
I never once thought
that you would find your way here.

1222
01:38:42,541 --> 01:38:43,541
Huh?

1223
01:38:49,250 --> 01:38:51,625
Gokul, in exchange for his Mishty,

1224
01:38:53,666 --> 01:38:58,416
was ready to sacrifice
so many other girls.

1225
01:38:59,166 --> 01:39:01,208
Because he was in a moral dilemma.

1226
01:39:02,958 --> 01:39:04,750
He had to choose his daughter.

1227
01:39:09,166 --> 01:39:12,166
Helpless as a father,
what could he have done?

1228
01:39:14,666 --> 01:39:15,708
But…

1229
01:39:17,458 --> 01:39:18,958
little did he know

1230
01:39:20,500 --> 01:39:22,708
that just like the other girls,

1231
01:39:24,750 --> 01:39:27,166
even Mishty would be sent

1232
01:39:27,833 --> 01:39:29,458
far away across the sea.

1233
01:39:31,291 --> 01:39:33,250
And there's something else he didn't know.

1234
01:39:35,041 --> 01:39:37,375
That even after doing all this,

1235
01:39:39,166 --> 01:39:40,916
he wouldn't get his daughter back.

1236
01:39:45,666 --> 01:39:48,916
According to our plan
and the alignment of stars,

1237
01:39:49,916 --> 01:39:52,083
