The other day, I let you go
thinking you were just a helpless mother.

1244
01:40:31,666 --> 01:40:34,583
<i>Tiny little swallow</i>

1245
01:40:35,791 --> 01:40:38,833
<i>Cute little swallow</i>

1246
01:40:40,000 --> 01:40:43,333
<i>Lost in the woods</i>

1247
01:40:44,250 --> 01:40:47,291
<i>This little swallow</i>

1248
01:40:47,375 --> 01:40:51,666
<i>She lost her way and went astray</i>

1249
01:40:51,750 --> 01:40:53,541
<i>Went astray</i>

1250
01:40:53,625 --> 01:40:56,000
Woosh…

1251
01:41:35,791 --> 01:41:39,500
The girls will definitely be gone.

1252
01:41:39,583 --> 01:41:41,500
And along with them,

1253
01:41:42,000 --> 01:41:45,375
you too.

1254
01:44:34,333 --> 01:44:36,333
Look at your daughter one last time.

1255
01:44:37,416 --> 01:44:40,458
Because this time, too,
you won't be able to save her.

1256
01:44:43,708 --> 01:44:47,875
And neither will your goddess be able
to save all those little girls.

1257
01:44:47,958 --> 01:44:52,958
Bani, say a final good bye
to your little swallow Mishty.

1258
01:44:53,041 --> 01:44:58,541
<i>Tiny little swallow, lost in the woods</i>

1259
01:44:59,166 --> 01:45:01,500
Tiny little swallow…

1260
01:45:02,041 --> 01:45:04,166
Uh, lost in the woods.

1261
01:45:04,875 --> 01:45:06,666
Tiny little swallow.

1262
01:45:09,833 --> 01:45:13,625
Leave from the Dakkhinpara gate,
meet me at entry behind the port.

1263
01:45:23,791 --> 01:45:25,208
Mamma.

1264
01:45:45,041 --> 01:45:46,625
Not this time.

1265
